rimination Penalties, and Trust Authority|\n|11|Corporation Governance Framework and Regulatory Compliance|\n\n**Table 3: NM Appeals Court Case Law Depth-0 H-Clusters**\n|#|Label|\n|---|---|\n|0|Real Property Rights and Interests|\n|1|Civil Liability and Injury Issues Arising from Healthcare Services|\n|2|Parental Rights and Custody Proceedings Involving Disputed Parental Fitness|\n|3|Motor Vehicle Insurance and Liability Claims Processing Procedures|\n|4|Mortgage Foreclosure and Secured Lending Frameworks|\n|5|Arraignments, Tribal Jurisdiction, Divorce, Bond Conditions,", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 23170, "end_char_idx": 24519, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "e07f7e78-9969-41a8-9713-909116ada3f0", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\Bridging Legal Knowledge and AI.md", "file_name": "Bridging Legal Knowledge and AI.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 52048, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "1d3f5bd7-239e-43d2-ae7f-1e7cd01c88fb", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\Bridging Legal Knowledge and AI.md", "file_name": "Bridging Legal Knowledge and AI.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 52048, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22"}, "hash": "8b9a69e79061b64e3a9958d47ca5223db6e2ffd6fcab4d00822647d6e5777090", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "1d33b476-a23a-488f-9ac1-946d18