 nature of the agent framework allows for the integration of additional retrieval strategies and data sources as needed.\n---\n# Use Case: Multi-Hop Question Answering\n\nPrompt: Which author influenced the mentor of J.K. Rowling?\n\n# System Process (GeAR Workflow):\n\n1. Top-Tier Agent: Evaluates the query\u2019s multi-hop nature and determines that a combination of graph expansion and document retrieval is necessary to answer the question.\n2. Graph Expansion Module:\n- Identifies that J.K. Rowling\u2019s mentor is a key entity in the query.\n- Traces the literary influences on that mentor by exploring graph-structured data on literary relationships.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 57647, "end_char_idx": 59506, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "[Excerpt from document]\n{metadata_str}\nExcerpt:\n-----\n{content}\n-----\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "d1ca971a-4a94-4dd2-be6e-a6afc5fc9f23", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_name": "AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 104275, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-20", "document_title": "\"Agentic Retrieval-Augmented Generation: Principles, Architectures, Applications, and Future Directions in Dynamic AI Systems Across Healthcare, Finance, and Education\""}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "63cc26e7-3760-4de7-9cea-369ed82e58d6", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_