ated list.\n\n# 4.4 Query Cross Comparison\n\nQuestions were formulated to query information about legal concepts from LLM channels. There were five questions from each.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 28739, "end_char_idx": 30326, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "[Excerpt from document]\n{metadata_str}\nExcerpt:\n-----\n{content}\n-----\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "56b83a38-6a6f-4133-8bf3-a44b55b7492f", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\Bridging Legal Knowledge and AI.md", "file_name": "Bridging Legal Knowledge and AI.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 52048, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22", "document_title": "\"Transforming Legal Research and Decision-Making: A Comprehensive Framework Integrating Retrieval-Augmented Generation, Knowledge Graphs, Semantic Understanding, and Advanced Machine Learning Techniques\""}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "1d3f5bd7-239e-43d2-ae7f-1e7cd01c88fb", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\Bridging Legal Knowledge and AI.md", "file_name": "Bridging Legal Knowledge and AI.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 52048, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22"}, "hash": "8b9a69e79061b64e3a9958d47ca5223db6e2ffd6fcab4d00822647d6e5777090", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "a6d844fb-6559-452c-8226-a896caff5aa4", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\Bridging Legal Knowledge and AI.md", "file_name": "Bridging Legal Knowledge and AI.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 52048, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22"}, "hash": "f7229b17dc3801155ff1a387dce9dabf427877e447a16eee9e008ba80611b209", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "3fc79f36-7ae8-4a21-bbf9-6cf4f4ff4bcd", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "ae82f7373844403f96f57459da6c7856882de44b0760c466b531325519502f93", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "# 4.4 Query Cross Comparison\n\nQuestions were formulated to query information about legal concepts from LLM channels. There were five questions from each.\n---\n# Bridging Legal Knowledge and AI:\n\n# Retrieval-Augmented Generation with Vector Stores, Knowledge Graphs, and Hierarchical Non-negative Matrix Factorization\n\n# ICAIL 2025, June 16\u201320, 2024, Chicago, IL, USA\n\n100% Attempted Accuracy across the selected databases: Approximate Number of Cases Mentioning 'Habeas Corpus': Over 1,300 ... Breakdown ...:\n\n- Pre-1950: 450\n- 1950-2000: 550\n- 2001-Present: 300\n\nThe responses highlight significant differences in model abilities. GPT-4 API and ChatGPT provided an understanding of their limits to offer real-time or exact counts due to limitations such as access to historical databases or the complexity of case records. Gemini followed a similar pattern, explaining why determining a precise number is challenging. In contrast, our system directly reported a specific count, stating 215 cases mentioning 'Habeas Corpus,' showing its ability to process and retrieve meaningful data. Meanwhile, nemotron:70b-instruct-q8_0 provided a detailed method to find the correct answer in an open context. It even went into breaking the count into approximate ranges across different periods, suggesting over 1,300 cases in total. However, these counts from Nemotron are part of an extreme h