red formats, tailored to specific use cases.\n- Recommendations and extracted insights are synthesized into concise and actionable reports.\n---\n# Agentic Document Workflows\n\n|Input Document|Agent Workflow|Structured|\n|---|---|---|\n|invoice|Pan Extract|Aeely Rules|\n| |Reconnendations|Coy Sunry|\n| | |Cerflarce Retert|\n| | |Decison|\n| | |Payrents|\n| | |Montaic Stat0|\n| | |Traek Contert|\n| | |Knouledge Base|\n\nFigure 23: An Overview of Agentic Document Workflows (ADW) [36]\n\n# Use Case: Invoice Payments Workflow\n\nPrompt: Generate a payment recommendation report based on the submitted invoice and associated vendor contract terms.\n\n# System Process (ADW Workflow):\n\n1. Parse the invoice to extract key details such as invoice number, date, vendor information, line items, and payment terms.\n2. Retrieve the corresponding vendor contract to verify payment terms and identify any applicable discounts or compliance requirements.\n3. Generate a payment recommendation report that includes original amount due, potential early payment discounts, budget impact analysis, and strategic payment actions.\n\n# Response:\n\nIntegrated Response: \"Invoice INV-2025-045 for $15,000.00 has been processed. An early payment discount of 2% is available if paid by 2025-04-10, reducing the amount due to $14,700.00. A bulk order discount of 5% was applied as the subtotal exceeded $10,000.00. It is recommended to approve early payment to save 2% and ensure timely fund allocation for upcoming project phases.\"\n\n# Key Features and Advantages\n\n- State Maintenance: Tracks document context and workflow stage, ensuring consistency across processes.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 61526, "end_char_idx": 63535, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "[Excerpt from document]\n{metadata_str}\nExcerpt:\n-----\n{content}\n-----\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "99da6ef5-9aea-464e-8a31-d336fdb3ac67", "embedding": null, "metadata": {