ing concise summaries, reflecting a trend towards extreme summarization techniques.\n\n7. **Semantic Compositionality**: The work by Socher et al. on recursive deep models addresses semantic compositionality, particularly in the context of sentiment analysis using a sentiment treebank.\n\nEntities mentioned include notable researchers (e.g., James Thorne, Neema Kotonya, Mor Geva, Shashi Narayan, Richard Socher) and various datasets (e.g., FEVER, WikiaSP) that contribute to advancements in NLP and AI systems."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "63cc26e7-3760-4de7-9cea-369ed82e58d6", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_name": "AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 104275, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-20"}, "hash": "42831f3d26ca4cfa6d94fdd9504869cdd0ae1fd50debb205f921f3f248abd7cc", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "32680891-7472-4c21-83ff-e6fc2f87cab6", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_name": "AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 104275, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-20"}, "hash": "032f230c4adbf66b9327476bcf950f87e2d05a11020086319f3db842628f8124", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "7d6d73e3-e442-4117-83b5-f726ae22cf3a", "node_type": "1", 