|\n| |CL-KL (NER)|73.76|59.16|68.46|92.86|1.96|\n| |BI-LSTM-CRF (NER)|75.12|60.96|70.45|75.0|1.64|\n| |AIstorian|83.69|74.14|80.54|39.29|0.43|\n|Ours|w/o. Multi-agents|83.03|74.34|81.16|57.14|1.14|\n| |w/o.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 12840, "end_char_idx": 13511, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "[Excerpt from document]\n{metadata_str}\nExcerpt:\n-----\n{content}\n-----\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "b8852e6c-75a9-478c-a386-0519e6959ef8", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_name": "AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 27860, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22", "document_title": "\"AIstorian: A Knowledge Graph-Driven Multi-Agent System for Accurate Biography Generation and Error Correction in Historical Research\"", "section_summary": "The section discusses the performance of various models in the context of a multi-agent system for historical biography generation and error correction, specifically focusing on the AIstorian project. Key topics include:\n\n1. **Model Performance Metrics**: The section presents retrieval performance metrics (Precision, Recall, F1 Score) for different models, highlighting the superior performance of the proposed model (\"Ours\") with a Precision of 0.936, Recall of 0.944, and F1 Score of 0.923 compared to other baselines.\n\n2. **Dataset**: The Jinshi dataset is utilized for evaluation, which consists of biographies of 173 Chinese historical figures and a knowledge base of ancient Chinese texts.\n\n3. **Baselines**: Six baseline models are considered for comparison:\n   - **mLongT5_large**: A multilingual model for text summarization.\n   - **Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct-AWQ**: A state-of-the-art (SOTA) open-sourced large language model (LLM) with 72.7 billion parameters.\n   - **TongGu**: A retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) system tailored for classical Chinese.\n   - **GraphRAG**: A knowledge graph-enhanced RAG system for query-focused summarization.\n   - **CL-KL (NER)**: A RAG system that incorporates named entity recognition.\n\nOverall, the section emphasizes the effectiveness of the AIstorian system in generating accurate biographies and correcting errors in historical research through advanced retrieval and generation techniques."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "86d6a30b-f854-412f-bc3d-7186c1cd0752", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_name": "AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 27860, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22"}, "hash": "13c05f2b3c34a30ab2b06b824e9bb3dd58f7f63367e6cdae60eac9f97a72c8ac", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "9c24c511-1c6c-4778-9f42-e5067694452c", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_name": "AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 27860, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22"}, "hash": "4db2606050ff6ee4463f6af7c5a305e29cae86e939a99b34ce7c09db5f4ba4a2", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "c2f9af7d-f997-4c92-a96f-ae5ce7e619bf", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "7f2344b5138d9a6514c966fc567b8259f6640d271100ad548a2693ce127ca333", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "Multi-agents|83.03|74.34|81.16|57.14|1.14|\n| |w/o. StylePO & Multi-agents|81.93|71.71|78.88|57.14|1.75|\n\n# Table 2: Retrieval performance\n\n|Model|Precision|Recall|F1 Score|\n|---|---|---|---|\n|TongGu|0.341|0.78|0.456|\n|GraphRAG|0.36|0.676|0.379|\n|CL-KL (NER)|0.623|0.478|0.518|\n|BI-LSTM-CRF (NER)|0.584|0.303|0.359|\n|Ours|0.936|0.944|0.923|\n\n# Experiments\n\n# 3.1 Experimental Settings\n\nDataset. We use the Jinshi dataset, a real-world historical dataset, for evaluation. It contains 173 Chinese historical figures with manually written biographies as ground truth and a knowledge base of ancient Chinese texts with approximately 220k Chinese characters.\n\nBaselines. We consider the following six baselines:\n\n1. mLongT5_large [22]: A multilingual LongT5_large [7] designed for text summarization.\n2. Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct-AWQ [19]: The SOTA open-sourced LLM with 72.7B parameters, featuring AWQ 4-bit quantization.\n3. TongGu [1]: A RAG system combining a classical Chinese-specific LLM, a SOTA retrieval model (Conan-embedding-v1), and a reranker (bge-large-zh-v1.5).\n4. GraphRAG [5]: A SOTA KG-enhanced RAG system for query-focused text summarization.\n5. CL-KL(NER)[23]: A RAG system on top of Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct, where retrieval index is built using a named entity recognition (NER) model trained by cooperative learning.\n6.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 13461, "end_char_idx": 14785, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "[Excerpt from document]\n{metadata_str}\nExcerpt:\n-----\n{content}\n-----\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "c2f9af7d-f997-4c92-a96f-ae5ce7e619bf", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_name": "AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 27860, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22", "document_title": "\"AIstorian: A Knowledge Graph-Driven Multi-Agent System for Accurate Biography Generation and Error Correction in Historical Research\"", "section_summary": "The section discusses the implementation and performance of \"AIstorian,\" a knowledge graph-driven multi-agent system designed for biography generation and error correction in historical research. Key topics and entities include:\n\n1. **Model Architecture**: The system utilizes a BI-LSTM-CRF model for Named Entity Recognition (NER) integrated with a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) framework based on Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct.\n\n2. **Implementation Details**: \n   - Training is conducted on NVIDIA GPUs (A40 46G and 4090 24G).\n   - The model training parameters include specific settings for the rank of LoRA, learning rates, batch sizes, and epochs for both the Supervised Fine-Tuning (SFT) and StylePO phases.\n   - The dataset is divided into training and test sets in an 80:20 ratio.\n\n3. **Performance Comparison**: \n   - AIstorian outperforms baseline models in biography generation quality by 11.4%-20.6% and reduces hallucination rates by 47.6%.\n   - The KG-based RAG component shows a 50% improvement in precision and a 21% improvement in recall compared to previous state-of-the-art (SOTA) methods.\n\n4. **Error-Aware Generation**: The multi-agent system enhances generation quality and reduces error rates, with ablation studies indicating the distinct roles of each component in the overall performance.\n\nOverall, the section highlights the effectiveness of AIstorian in improving historical biography generation through advanced machine learning techniques and a structured approach to error correction."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "86d6a30b-f854-412f-bc3d-7186c1cd0752", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_name": "AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 27860, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22"}, "hash": "13c05f2b3c34a30ab2b06b824e9bb3dd58f7f63367e6cdae60eac9f97a72c8ac", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "b8852e6c-75a9-478c-a386-0519e6959ef8", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_name": "AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 27860, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22"}, "hash": "a454d870d9c4d9a086e484c6bbee4ea90d54d55bb72809e163c5b1938781e337", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "4ad757f8-fb88-416d-a6ae-b006ad9ac199", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "49d506e1f96fd04eef8c4926d901f90c22832775496b34c10692ade8d4064658", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "6. BI-LSTM-CRF(NER) [8]: A RAG system on top of Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct, where retrieval index is built by an NER model based on BI-LSTM networks and a CRF layer.\n\nImplementation details. Baseline parameters follow the original papers. The model training is conducted on an A40 46G GPU, while other experiments are run on an NVIDIA 4090 24G GPU. The RAG component uses LangChain [2] and the multi-agent system uses Qwen-Agent [6]. We employ Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct [19] as the foundation for both training model and multi-agents. In the SFT phase, the rank of LoRA is set to 32, the learning rate is 2e-4, the batch size is 8 and the model is trained for 2 epochs. In the StylePO phase, the rank of LoRA is set to 8, the learning rate is 5e-6, the batch size is 8, and the model is trained for 3 epochs. The dataset is split into a training set and a test set in the ratio of 8:2.\n\n# 3.2 Performance Comparison\n\nOverall performance. Table 1 presents the comparison of AIstorian and all baselines. As observed, AIstorian consistently outperforms all baselines, achieving 11.4%-20.6% improvements in biography generation quality and a 47.6% reduction in hallucination rate compared to the previous SOTA methods.\n\nKG-based RAG. We compare the KG-based RAG component with the RAG-based baselines. Table 2 lists the experimental results. Our KG-based RAG achieves a 50% improvement in precision and a 21% improvement in recall over the previous SOTA, demonstrating its superior retrieval efficacy.\n\nError-aware biography generation. Thanks to error-aware generation with multi-agents, AIstorian achieves better generation quality and a lower error rate than baselines. In addition, we show that each component plays different roles according to ablation studies.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 14783, "end_char_idx": 16532, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "[Excerpt from document]\n{metadata_str}\nExcerpt:\n-----\n{content}\n-----\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "4ad757f8-fb88-416d-a6ae-b006ad9ac199", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_name": "AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 27860, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22", "document_title": "\"AIstorian: A Knowledge Graph-Driven Multi-Agent System for Accurate Biography Generation and Error Correction in Historical Research\"", "section_summary": "The section discusses the AIstorian, a knowledge graph (KG)-powered multi-agent system designed for generating accurate historical biographies and correcting errors in historical research. Key topics include:\n\n1. **System Overview**: AIstorian utilizes a KG-powered retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) mechanism and employs multiple agents to enhance biography generation.\n2. **Research Findings**: The paper presents findings from ablation studies indicating that while multi-agent systems can reduce hallucination rates, they may negatively affect creativity, as measured by ROUGE scores.\n3. **Significance**: This work is noted as the first to generate historical biographies from a large corpus, demonstrating significant improvements in biography quality and a reduction in hallucinations.\n4. **Authors and Affiliations**: The authors include Sewon Min, Kalpesh Krishna, Xinxi Lyu, Mike Lewis, Wen-tau Yih, Pang Koh, and Fengyu Li, with Fengyu Li being an intern at Huawei and a graduate student at Zhejiang University.\n5. **Company Background**: Huawei is highlighted as a leader in ICT solutions, focusing on digital transformation and innovation through cloud computing, AI, and big data.\n\nThe section also includes references to related works and tools in the field of natural language processing and knowledge-grounded models."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "86d6a30b-f854-412f-bc3d-7186c1cd0752", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_name": "AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 27860, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22"}, "hash": "13c05f2b3c34a30ab2b06b824e9bb3dd58f7f63367e6cdae60eac9f97a72c8ac", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "c2f9af7d-f997-4c92-a96f-ae5ce7e619bf", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_name": "AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 27860, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22"}, "hash": "2226dffe52b1f85441719422063b986a07891b328c00425896b709716ef00525", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "38613ccd-a9b6-4ca0-a4b0-0e91440dc984", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "a2557832c2b715f59a7fba07c227cdc2142abfec7ad9e93cdda400a270e64c05", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "In addition, we show that each component plays different roles according to ablation studies. For example, multi-agents improve hallucination rates but negatively impact creativity (measured by ROUGE scores).\n\n# 4 Conclusion\n\nIn this paper, we propose AIstorian, an innovative KG-powered multi-agent system towards accurate historical biography generation, which is featured with a KG-powered RAG mechanism and error-aware biography generation with multi-agents. To the best of our knowledge, this is the first work to generate historical biographies from a massive corpus. The experimental results demonstrate that our system significantly improves the quality of biography generation and alleviates hallucinations.\n---\n# AIstorian lets AI be a historian: A KG-powered multi-agent system for accurate biography generation\n\n# Conference acronym \u2019XX, June 03\u201305, 2018, Woodstock, NY\n\n# Presenter & Company Biography\n\nSewon Min, Kalpesh Krishna, Xinxi Lyu, Mike Lewis, Wen-tau Yih, Pang Koh, Fengyu Li is currently an intern at Huawei and a graduate student in the Software Engineering at Zhejiang University. His research interests mainly focus on RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) and natural language processing.\n\nHuawei is a global leader in information and communications technology (ICT) solutions. It offers comprehensive services and solutions to help enterprises and developers achieve digital transformation and innovation, with its strong technical capabilities in cloud computing, AI, and big data.\n\n# References\n\n1. Jiahuan Cao, Dezhi Peng, Peirong Zhang, Yongxin Shi, Yang Liu, Kai Ding, and Lianwen Jin. 2024. TongGu: Mastering Classical Chinese Understanding with Knowledge-Grounded Large Language Models. arXiv preprint arXiv:2407.03937 (2024).\n2. Harrison Chase. 2022. LangChain. https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchain\n3. Tong Chen, Hongwei Wang, Sihao Chen, Wenhao Yu, Kaixin Ma, Xinran Zhao, Hongming Zhang, and Dong Yu. 2024.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 16439, "end_char_idx": 18389, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "[Excerpt from document]\n{metadata_str}\nExcerpt:\n-----\n{content}\n-----\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "38613ccd-a9b6-4ca0-a4b0-0e91440dc984", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_name": "AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 2786