kok, Thailand, 6498\u20136526. doi:10.18653/v1/2024.findings-acl.388\n11. Chin-Yew Lin. 2004. ROUGE: A Package for Automatic Evaluation of Summaries. In Text Summarization Branches Out. Association for Computational Linguistics, Barcelona, Spain, 74\u201381. https://aclanthology.org/W04-1013/\n12.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 19608, "end_char_idx": 20872, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "[Excerpt from document]\n{metadata_str}\nExcerpt:\n-----\n{content}\n-----\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "79ff1081-561f-4a55-b857-73f177675dea", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_name": "AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 27860, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22", "document_title": "\"AIstorian: A Knowledge Graph-Driven Multi-Agent System for Accurate Biography Generation and Error Correction in Historical Research\"", "section_summary": "The section primarily discusses recent research and developments in the field of artificial intelligence, particularly focusing on large language models (LLMs) and their applications in various tasks such as biography generation, summarization, and error correction in historical research. Key topics include:\n\n1. **Knowledge Graphs and Multi-Agent Systems**: The document highlights the use of knowledge graphs in creating a multi-agent system named \"AIstorian,\" which aims to enhance the accuracy of biography generation and improve error correction in historical research.\n\n2. **Long-Context LLM Inference**: The paper by Di Liu et al. introduces \"RetrievalAttention,\" a method designed to accelerate inference in long-context LLMs through vector retrieval techniques.\n\n3. **Instruction Controllable Summarization**: Yixin Liu and colleagues present a benchmarking study on the generation and evaluation capabilities of LLMs specifically for instruction-controllable summarization tasks.\n\n4. **Preference Optimization**: The work by Yu Meng et al. discusses \"Simpo,\" a method for simple preference optimization that utilizes a reference-free reward system.\n\n5. **Supporting Answers with Verified Quotes**: Jacob Menick and his team explore the training of language models to provide answers that are supported by verified quotes, enhancing the reliability of the information generated.\n\nEntities mentioned include various authors and their affiliations, as well as specific conferences and journals where the research was presented or published, such as the Association for Computational Linguistics and Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "86d6a30b-f854-412f-bc3d-7186c1cd0752", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_name": "AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 27860, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22"}, "hash": "13c05f2b3c34a30ab2b06b824e9bb3dd58f7f63367e6cdae60eac9f97a72c8ac", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "e56ad6e1-fe91-4d54-b907-e45fdfd51943", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_name": "AIstorian lets AI be a 