ure Hu E, who served as a judicial officer in Songjiang Prefecture during the Shunzhi era of the Qing dynasty. Key topics include Hu E's integrity, administrative diligence, and scholarly contributions, particularly his meticulous research on the Book of Documents. The excerpt also highlights his background, including his birth in 1630 in Yuyao County, Zhejiang Province, and his academic achievements, such as ranking seventy-ninth in the palace examination and being granted the title of Jinshi. Additionally, the section references a performance improvement in a multi-agent system called StylePO, which enhances ROUGE scores and reduces atomic fact errors by 35%, indicating a focus on advancements in AI-driven historical research methodologies."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "86d6a30b-f854-412f-bc3d-7186c1cd0752", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_name": "AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 27860, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22"}, "hash": "13c05f2b3c34a30ab2b06b824e9bb3dd58f7f63367e6cdae60eac9f97a72c8ac", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "5b2103ef-dba1-4b22-b3e3-8b4cc83b5c59", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_name": "AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 27860, "creatio