rveys, 48(2), 1\u201127.\n6. Ebert, C., & Cihak, D. (2015). Is machine learning the magic bullet for predictive quality improvement? IEEE Software, 32(6), 20\u201125.\n7. Garcez, A., & Zaverucha, G. (1999). The connection between neural logic and probabilistic networks. Neural Computation, 11(8), 2065\u20112091.\n8. Ghotra, B., McIntosh, S., & Hassan, A. E. (2015). Revisiting the impact of classification techniques on the performance of defect prediction models. In Proceedings of the 37th International Conference on Software Engineering (ICSE) (pp. 789\u2011799).\n9. Hall, T., Beecham, S., & Bowes, D. (2012). Using an empirical study of defect prediction: A practitioner's perspective. In Proceedings of the 18th IEEE International Requirements Engineering Conference (pp. 162\u2011171).\n10. Hinton, G. E. (2010). Connectionist learning procedures. Artificial Intelligence, 40(1\u20113), 185\u2011234.\n11.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 36236, "end_char_idx": 37701, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "[Excerpt from document]\n{metadata_str}\nExcerpt:\n-----\n{content}\n-----\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "911a307f-1804-4ce6-9c19-ce1642e42258", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\Artificial Intelligence in Quality Assurance for Software Systems.md", "file_name": "Artificial Intelligence in Quality Assurance for Software Systems.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 46770, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-21", "document_title": "\"Transforming Software Quality Assurance: The Integration of Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, and Predictive Analytics for Enhanced Testing, Defect Detection, and User Experience\"", "section_summary": "The section discusses the integration of artificial intelligence (AI), machine learning (ML), and predictive analytics in the field of software 