 B., & Kumar, R. L. (2020). AI\u2011based regression testing techniques: Challenges and future directions.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 37598, "end_char_idx": 38974, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "[Excerpt from document]\n{metadata_str}\nExcerpt:\n-----\n{content}\n-----\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "4e88c875-9392-40ce-ba8d-3db2b97997ef", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\Artificial Intelligence in Quality Assurance for Software Systems.md", "file_name": "Artificial Intelligence in Quality Assurance for Software Systems.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 46770, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-21", "document_title": "\"Transforming Software Quality Assurance: The Integration of Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, and Predictive Analytics for Enhanced Testing, Defect Detection, and User Experience\"", "section_summary": "The section provides a list of academic references related to the integration of artificial intelligence (AI), machine learning (ML), and predictive analytics in software quality assurance. Key topics include:\n\n1. **AI in Software Testing**: The challenges and future directions of AI-based regression testing techniques.\n2. **Machine Learning for Fault Prediction**: A systematic review of ML techniques aimed at predicting software faults.\n3. **Information Retrieval**: An introduction to information retrieval, which may relate to how AI can enhance data handling in software testing.\n4. **Defect Prediction**: The use of data mining on static code attributes to identify potential defects in software.\n5. **Automated Test Case Generation**: Approaching test case generation as a constraint-solving problem, highlighting automation in testing processes.\n6. **Machine Learning Libraries**: The introduction and application of Scikit-learn, a prominent ML library in Python.\n7. **Sentiment Analysis**: Utilizing deep learning for analyzing user feedback, which can inform quality assurance practices.\n8. **Language Understanding**: Improving language comprehension through generative pre-training, relevant for enhancing user experience in software systems.\n\nEntities mentioned include various authors and their contributions to the field, as well as specific journals and technical reports that focus on these topics."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "f30f272f-f44c-45fa-a7a9-1bbf727c984d", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\Artificial Intelligence in Quality Assurance for Software Systems.md", "file_name": "Artificial Intelligence in Quality Assurance for Software Systems.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 46770, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-21"}, "hash": "5dbad9039ae67ed68798be7d57a52b3f05b9390adf56748e90646287c8345de5", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "911a307f-1804-4ce6-9c19-ce1642e42258", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\Artificial Intelligence in Quality Assurance for Software Systems.md", "file_name": "Artificial Intelligence in Quality Assurance for Software Systems.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 46770, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-21"}, "hash": "37c841d8ba4da3f0f1d67f8e2c675d42dc879422d65f40be8f12bab024ebb47a", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "439d6f35-f5ad-4683-b9a6-d19d9cc7fcc9", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "f