, machine learning (ML), and predictive analytics in the field of software quality assurance (QA). Key topics include:\n\n1. **AI and Automation in Quality Assurance**: The role of AI and automation tools in enhancing QA methodologies and practices.\n2. **Data Integration and Analytics**: Techniques for cross-platform analytics and big data analytics, particularly in finance, banking, and civil engineering.\n3. **Optimization Strategies**: Strategies for optimizing SQL Business Intelligence (BI) in financial contexts.\n4. **Research Contributions**: Multiple contributions from authors such as Sai Krishna Shiramshetty and Mouna Mothey, focusing on various aspects of data integration, big data applications, and automation in QA.\n5. **Recent Publications**: The section lists several recent publications (from 2019 to 2023) that provide insights into modern QA tools, techniques, and methodologies.\n\nEntities mentioned include:\n- Authors: Sai Krishna Shiramshetty, Mouna Mothey\n- Journals: Integrated Journal for Research in Arts and Humanities, International Journal of Scientific Research in Computer Science, Engineering and Information Technology, International Journal of Scientific Research in Civil Engineering, Eduzone, Stallion Journal for Multidisciplinary Associated Research Studies.\n- Topics: SQL BI optimization, data integration techniques, big data analytics, automation in QA, and AI in automated testing environments. \n\nOverall, the section highlights the evolving landscape of software quality assurance through the lens of advanced technologies and research contributions."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "f30f272f-f44c-45fa-a7a9-1bbf727c984d", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\