ificial intelligence (AI) and natural language processing (NLP) in the medical field, particularly focusing on the use of chatbots and their effectiveness in various healthcare scenarios. Key topics include:\n\n1. **Adverse Drug Event Detection**: The use of NLP for identifying adverse drug events through supervised learning methods.\n2. **Lung Cancer Diagnosis and Prognosis**: The role of AI in diagnosing and predicting outcomes for lung cancer patients.\n3. **Computer-Aided Diagnosis in Oncology**: Applications of NLP in enhancing diagnostic processes in oncology.\n4. **NLP in Ophthalmology**: Challenges and experiences related to using advanced NLP models like GPT-3 in ophthalmic practices.\n5. **Health Chatbots**: A case study on the real-world utilization of self-diagnosis health chatbots.\n6. **Symptom Checkers**: A systematic review of the diagnostic accuracy of online symptom checkers.\n7. **Generative Pretrained Transformers**: A pilot study evaluating the diagnostic accuracy of differential-diagnosis lists generated by GPT-3 chatbots for common clinical complaints.\n\nEntities mentioned include various studies, authors, and journals that contribute to the understanding of AI and NLP applications in healthcare. The section highlights the current status, challenges, and potential future opportunities for these technologies in medical applications."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "dad35ff1-58aa-45cb-b326-0446ff627bda", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\Chatbots and Their Applications in Medical Fields Current Status.md", "file_name": "Chatbots and Their Applications in Medical Fields Current Status.md"