et al. The potential of ChatGPT as a self-diagnostic tool in common orthopedic diseases: exploratory study. J Med Internet Res. 2023;25:e47621.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 22553, "end_char_idx": 23905, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "[Excerpt from document]\n{metadata_str}\nExcerpt:\n-----\n{content}\n-----\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "f2095b32-2bc2-4e3e-90c3-c742d02c9eec", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\Chatbots and Their Applications in Medical Fields Current Status.md", "file_name": "Chatbots and Their Applications in Medical Fields Current Status.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 28958, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-23", "document_title": "\"Advancing Healthcare: A Comprehensive Review of Chatbots and AI in Medical Applications, Trends, Challenges, and Future Opportunities\"", "section_summary": "The section discusses the application of ChatGPT and artificial intelligence (AI) in the field of orthopedics and sports medicine. Key topics include:\n\n1. **Self-Diagnostic Tools**: The potential of ChatGPT as a self-diagnostic tool for common orthopedic diseases is highlighted in an exploratory study published in the Journal of Medical Internet Research.\n\n2. **Patient Interaction**: Research assessing ChatGPT's responses to common patient inquiries about total hip arthroplasty is mentioned, indicating its role in patient education and interaction.\n\n3. **AI in Orthopedics**: Several studies explore the integration of AI and ChatGPT in orthopedic practices, including its applications in sports medicine and foot and ankle surgery.\n\n4. **Current Trends and Reviews**: A scoping review on the understanding of AI and machine learning in orthopedics is referenced, showcasing the growing interest and research in this area.\n\n5. **Future Opportunities**: The section implies ongoing research and future opportunities for AI in orthopedic design and treatment methodologies.\n\nEntities mentioned include various authors and their respective studies, as well as specific journals such as the Journal of Medical Internet Research, Journal of Bone and Joint Surgery, and others. The studies collectively emphasize the evolving role of AI technologies in enhancing orthopedic care and patient outcomes."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "dad35ff1-58aa-45cb-b326-0446ff627bda", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\Chatbots and Their Applications in Medical Fields Current Status.md", "file_name": "Chatbots and Their Applications in Medical Fields Current Status.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 28958, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-23"}, "hash": "4d0315e8f144da5f7f359eae5fa855cbb6e34f8f15c19f56fd0a30b52a22b7b2", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "77211096-7ae8-46c0-be35-2f18425af6d0", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\Chatbots and Their Applications in Medical Fields Current Status.md", "file_name": "Chatbots and Their Applications in Medical Fields Current Status.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 28958, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-23"}, "hash": "2b5d1e358499999725e1e9cfef13cd72780a54e1cbee9d97c4c03d1746e08fd4", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "9845cc6c-7638-40e7-a52a-f616aac1e6a3", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "489784dcc53bd2dc2dacd7726f3726fe35280a13a7