erpt:\n-----\n{content}\n-----\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "d95a1e3e-560b-467b-802d-293df5af24ed", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\COMPUTER SYSTEM VALIDATION EXAMPLE OF QUALITY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM.md", "file_name": "COMPUTER SYSTEM VALIDATION EXAMPLE OF QUALITY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 53509, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-21", "document_title": "\"Comprehensive Approaches to Quality Management and Computer System Validation in the Pharmaceutical Industry: Regulatory Frameworks, Best Practices, and Case Studies\"", "section_summary": "The section discusses various aspects of quality management and computer system validation (CSV) within the pharmaceutical industry, highlighting regulatory frameworks, best practices, and case studies. Key topics include:\n\n1. **GAMP5 Life Cycle Models**: Reference to McDowall's work on understanding and interpreting these models for software validation.\n2. **Regulatory Compliance**: Mention of 21CFR Part 11 compliance and systems validation, as outlined by MetricStream.\n3. **Good Practices**: Guidance from the Pharmaceutical Inspection Co-Operation Scheme (PIC/S) on computerized systems in regulated environments.\n4. **Data Integrity**: Importance of data integrity in the pharmaceutical industry, with a reference to a presentation by Ranbaxy Laboratories.\n5. **Quality System Design**: Discussion on designing quality systems for computer system validation, as explored by Sallubier and Rusjan.\n6. **Role of CSV**: Examination of the role of computer system validation in safeguarding data integrity, as reviewed by Sai et al.\n7. **Research Methodology**: Reference to research methods relevant to business students, as outlined by Saunders et al.\n8. **Case Studies**: The use of case studies as a persuasive tool in management research, as discussed by Siggelkow.\n\nEntities mentioned include various authors, organizations (e.g., MetricStream, PIC/S), and publications related to quality management and validation practices in the pharmaceutical sector."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "2f2b69d9-5dae-4221-9dcb-f2fbedd34145", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\COMPUTER SYSTEM VALIDATION EXAMPLE OF QUALITY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM.md", "file_name": "COMPUTER SYSTEM VALIDATION EXAMPLE OF QUALITY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 53509, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-21"}, "hash": "1137d67616953033e3ad92507bb961ae6095138365fd269914446ae7383f7d2e", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "9e00de9d-4532-4452-8a8f-4a9892237741", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\COMPUTER SYSTEM VALIDATION EXAMPLE OF QUALITY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM.md", "file_name": "COMPUTER SYSTEM VALIDATION EXAMPLE OF QUALITY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 53509, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-21"}, "hash": "423398dadf00a5ed5d52b5ebe0f4bcee69512d703b4a32ef451a3e07a9e2b166", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "2773fb26-b280-41fd-a152-5d9b8d149792", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "f3fbaa011768b52ccfd37dfbab12e2d958a4e69a4435688df17a9d9a4dc46551", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "McDowall, R. D. (2010). Understanding and interpreting the GAMP5 life cycle models fo