gulatory Frameworks, Best Practices, and Case Studies\"", "section_summary": "The section discusses the integration of Quality Management Systems (QMS) with Computer System Validation (CSV) in the pharmaceutical industry. It references several key documents and guidelines from the U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA), including:\n\n1. **FDA Guidance for Industry (2006)** - Focuses on a quality systems approach to Current Good Manufacturing Practice (CGMP) regulations.\n2. **CFR Title 21, Part 211 (2013)** - Outlines CGMP for finished pharmaceuticals.\n3. **CFR Title 21, Part 11 (2013)** - Addresses electronic records and electronic signatures.\n4. **Velkovrh Remec (2007)** - Discusses validation processes in the pharmaceutical industry.\n5. **Yin (2009)** - Provides insights into case study research methodologies.\n\nThe section also includes a summary of a paper that aims to present a QMS for validating computer systems and illustrates the validation process through a practical case study from a pharmaceutical company."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "2f2b69d9-5dae-4221-9dcb-f2fbedd34145", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\COMPUTER SYSTEM VALIDATION EXAMPLE OF QUALITY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM.md", "file_name": "COMPUTER SYSTEM VALIDATION EXAMPLE OF QUALITY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 53509, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-21"}, "hash": "1137d67616953033e3ad92507bb961ae6095138365fd269914446ae7383f7d2e", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "2773fb26-b280-41fd-a152-5d9b8d149792", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\COMPUTER SYSTEM VALIDATION EXAMPLE OF QUALITY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM.md", "file_name": "COMPUTER SYSTEM VALIDATION EXAMPLE OF QUALITY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 53509, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-21"}, "hash": "25577b273d43eee40aff04891c35c090e6fea628fc3ef0629d3c8a23b521e71c", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "873c18bd-a885-47d6-a3e0-b722f3ef672e", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "a102d12703c1c369eb184f326491fc1ac86c4d85ae87d3cf5cbd6396da613f83", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "Food and Drug Administration - FDA (2006). Guidance for Industry, Quality Systems Approach to Pharmaceutical CGMP Regulations, available at: http://www.fda.gov/downloads/Drugs/....../Guidances/UCM070337.pdf (accessed 25 February 2017).|\n|---|---|\n|31.|U.S. Food and Drug Administration - FDA (2013a). CFR \u2013 Code of Federal Regulations Title 21, Volume 4 \u2013 Part 211 Current Good Manufacturing Practice for Finished Pharmaceuticals, available at: http://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cdrh/cfdocs/cfcfr/cfrsearch.cfm?cfrpart=211 (accessed 26 December 2013).|\n|32.|U.S. Food and Drug Administration \u2013 FDA (2013b). CFR \u2013 Code of Federal Regulations Title 21, Volume 4 \u2013 Part 11 Electronic Records; Electronic Signatures, available at: http://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cdrh/cfdocs/cfcfr/cfrsearch.cfm?cfrpart=11 (accessed 26 December 2013).|\n|33.|Velkovrh Remec, B. (2007). Validation in pharmaceutical industry, available at: http://www.scribd.com/doc/23022819/VALIDACIJE (accessed 25 February 2017).|\n|34.|Yin, R.K. (2009), Case study research: Design and methods, 4\u1d57\u02b0 ed., Sage, Thousand Oaks.|\n\n# VALIDACIJA RA\u010cUNALNOG SUSTAVA: PRIMJER UPRAVLJANJA DIZAJNA SUSTAVA UPRAVLJANJA KVALITETOM I PROCESNE IMPLEMENTACIJE\n\n# Sa\u017eetak\n\nCilj ovog rada je prezentacija sustava upravljanja kvalitetom (Quality Management System - QMS) za validaciju ra\u010dunalnih sustava te prikaz validacijskog procesa na prakti\u010dnom slu\u010daju farmaceutske tvrtke.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 50445, "end_char_idx": 51877, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "[Excerpt from document]\n{metadata_str}\nExcerpt:\n-----\n{content}\n-----\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "873c18bd-a885-47d6-a3e0-b722f3ef672e", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\COMPUTER SYSTEM VALIDATION EXAMPLE OF QUALITY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM.md", "file_name": "COMPUTER SYSTEM VALIDATION EXAMPLE OF QUALITY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 53509, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-21", "document_title": "\"Comprehensive Approaches to Quality Management and Computer System Validation in the Pharmaceutical Industry: Regulatory Frameworks, Best Practices, and Case Studies\"", "section_summary": "The section discusses the Quality Management System (QMS) for the validation of computer system elements based on European and American legal requirements. It outlines a validation process using a general V-model, providing insights into practical implementation. The validation of computer systems within an organization can rely on both general and specific standard operating procedures that constitute the QMS. Key activities in the validation process include planning, specification, development/building, verification, and reporting, illustrated through process diagrams based on a practical example involving a Supervisory Control and Data Acquisition (SCADA) system for production management. The empirical part of the work employs two research strategies: case study and action research. The presented validation processes and examples of quality management systems offer guidance for companies that rely on computer systems. Although the QMS and validation process are based on a specific pharmaceutical company's legal requirements, the experiences from this highly regulated industry can be applicable to less regulated industries as well.\n\nKey topics and entities:\n- Quality Management System (QMS)\n- Computer System Validation\n- European and American legal requirements\n- V-model\n- Supervisory Control and Data Acquisition (SCADA)\n- Validation activities: planning, specification, development, verification, reporting\n- Research strategies: case study, action research\n- Pharmaceutical industry\n- Regulatory frameworks and best practices"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "2f2b69d9-5dae-4221-9dcb-f2fbedd34145", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\COMPUTER SYSTEM VALIDATION EXAMPLE OF QUALITY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM.md", "file_name": "COMPUTER SYSTEM VALIDATION EXAMPLE OF QUALITY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 53509, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-21"}, "hash": "1137d67616953033e3ad92507bb961ae6095138365fd269914446ae7383f7d2e", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "c0473b25-9bde-4761-9b15-eae5a4841a8e", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\COMPUTER SYSTEM VALIDATION EXAMPLE OF QUALITY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM.md", "file_name": "COMPUTER SYSTEM VALIDATION EXAMPLE OF QUALITY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 53509, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-21"}, "hash": "b870ed061dc9cf2b9f1466af8d2174e54c398c4a83b5a2be9b1ec968d5def509", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "8bee8365-db77-453a-a440-d4666eb4ee08", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "5d09627f5e499ad4180ab72ab2833c2bb2bff81057987e3510f073e418b97697", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "Na temelju europskih i ameri\u010dkih pravnih zahtjeva, definiramo QMS za validaciju elemenata ra\u010dunalnog sustava. Primjer procesa validacije, zasnovan na kori\u0161tenju op\u0107eg V-modela, pru\u017ea detaljno razumijevanje prakti\u010dne implementacije validacije u praksi. Validacija ra\u010dunalnog sustava u konkretnoj organizaciji mo\u017ee se temeljiti na op\u0107im i specifi\u010dnim standardnim operativnim procedurama, koje formiraju QMS. Validacijske aktivnosti planiranja, specificiranja, razvoja/izgradnje, verificiranja i izvje\u0161tavanja se prezentiraju kori\u0161tenjem procesnih dijagrama, zasnovanih na prakti\u010dnom primjeru validacije ra\u010dunalnog sustava za upravljanje proizvodnjom Supervisory Control and Data Acquisition (SCADA). Empirijski dio rada koristi dvije istra\u017eiva\u010dke strategije: studiju slu\u010daja i akcijsko istra\u017eivanje. Predstavljeni procesa validacije, kao i primjer ra\u010dunalnog sustava za upravljanje kvalitetom mogu pru\u017eiti smjernice za sva poduze\u0107a, kojima su ra\u010dunalni sustavi zna\u010dajni. Iako se prezentirani QMS i proces validacije ra\u010dunalnog sustava zasnivaju na primjeru konkretnog farmaceutskog poduze\u0107a i njegovih pravnih zahtjeva, iskustva iz visoko regulirane industrije se mogu na odgovaraju\u0107i na\u010din koristiti i u manje reguliranim industrijama.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 51878, "end_char_idx": 53112, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "[Excerpt from document]\n{metadata_str}\nExcerpt:\n-----\n{content}\n-----\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, 