cific coefficients (\u03b1K,0, \u03b1K,1, \u03b1K,2) indicating that output generation is typically more energy-intensive.\n\n3. **Challenges of Memory Module Design**: The section highlights the challenges associated with existing memory module designs, which often prioritize performance over computational efficiency. It identifies three critical phases in memory architecture: \n   - Memory Formation: Organizing input data into storage.\n   - Memory Reading: Optimizing retrieval processes.\n   - Memory Utilization: Enhancing answer generation through effective memory use.\n\nOverall, the excerpt emphasizes the need to balance energy efficiency, performance, and resource consumption in the design of memory-augmented LLMs."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "5bbe2f3b-a5cf-473e-9e50-1d182dcad9fb", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\ADDRESSING THE SUSTAINABLE AI TRILEMMA A CASE STUDY ON LLM AGENTS AND RAG.md", "file_name": "ADDRESSING THE SUSTAINABLE AI TRILEMMA A CASE STUDY ON LLM AGENTS AND RAG.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 72913, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22"}, "hash": "47c48bbdebdc34c45547d1ddc9efb86758d4c6bea59cc0a6ae9786ef666e699e", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "8dc10db9-10b4-4290-a5cf-18d625c4d261", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\ADDRESSING THE SUSTAINABLE AI TRILEMMA A CASE STUDY ON LLM AGENTS AND RAG.md", "file_name": "ADDRESSING THE SUSTAINABLE AI TRILEMMA A CASE STUDY ON LLM AGENTS AND RAG.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 