kloads and resource consumption. Through analyzing different components of memory-augmented frameworks, we identify three critical phases in modern LLM memory architecture: (a) Memory Formation, which processes and organizes internal/external input data into storage structures; (b-c) Memory Reading, encompassing retrieval necessity detection and query optimization for better retrieval; and (d-f) Memory utilization, to generate better answers by optimizing memory usage.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 15814, "end_char_idx": 17738, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "[Excerpt from document]\n{metadata_str}\nExcerpt:\n-----\n{content}\n-----\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "ddf54b42-5681-48be-b13e-3ce031e9e2f8", "embedding": [0.015313129872083664, 0.043923068791627884, 0.06288737058639526, -0.005343928001821041, 0.029672594740986824, 0.037247415632009506, 0.04351435601711273, 0.037192922085523605, -0.00974100362509489, 0.0365389809012413, 0.05454961955547333, -0.05509456992149353, -0.010837717913091183, -0.021103236824274063, -0.02290157601237297, -0.027819760143756866, -0.019822601228952408, -0.035885039716959, 0.004710422363132238, 0.027411047369241714, 0.05452237278223038, 0.04495847597718239, 0.01306520588696003, 0.04495847597718239, 0.009795498102903366, -0.012275027111172676, 0.02158006839454174, 0.03337826207280159, -0.010367697104811668, -0.029808832332491875, 0.032233864068984985, -0.027901504188776016, -0.046484339982271194, -0.02138933539390564, -0.010013478808104992, 0.0705166906118393, -0.018037885427474976, -0.0035149354953318834, 0.004632085561752319, 0.010238271206617355, -0.007261475082486868, -0.04569416120648384, -0.02001333422958851, 0.03999942168593407, -0.025367479771375656, 0.034795135259628296, -0.00627034530043602, 0.007295534946024418, -0.017329448834061623, 0.04533994197845459, -0.055966492742300034, 0.01656651683151722, 0.013480731286108494, -0.004529907368123531, -0.0011724967043