 retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) evaluation.\n\n5. **Prompt Engineering**: Ordinary LLM inference was implemented using prompt engineering techniques for other operations.\n\nEntities mentioned include:\n- Datasets: LoCoMo, HotpotQA, MuSiQue, ArXiv\n- Metrics: GERR, EFR, ECR\n- Method: HyDE (for query optimization)\n- Operations: Memory reading and utilization operations\n\nOverall, the section emphasizes the experimental approach to evaluating memory operations in AI systems, focusing on efficiency and effectiveness in query handling."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "5bbe2f3b-a5cf-473e-9e50-1d182dcad9fb", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\ADDRESSING THE SUSTAINABLE AI TRILEMMA A CASE STUDY ON LLM AGENTS AND RAG.md", "file_name": "ADDRESSING THE SUSTAINABLE AI TRILEMMA A CASE STUDY ON LLM AGENTS AND RAG.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 72913, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22"}, "hash": "47c48bbdebdc34c45547d1ddc9efb86758d4c6bea59cc0a6ae9786ef666e699e", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "7cea014e-89cd-430a-9519-93e39a6346b5", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\ADDRESSING THE SUSTAINABLE AI TRILEMMA A CASE STUDY ON LLM AGENTS AND RAG.md", "file_name": "ADDRESSING THE SUSTAINABLE AI TRILEMMA A CASE STUDY ON LLM AGENTS AND RAG.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 72913, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22"}, "hash": "e035e4b8a662f860dafb84890bf6afc67b1f6ef505d9417b32b604529a519a22", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, 