Emergence of AI Agents**: The rise of LLM-based agents is surveyed, indicating their potential and the challenges they present.\n\n5. **Ethical Considerations**: The need for evaluations of sustainability, privacy, digital equity, and ethics in AI technologies, particularly in the context of tools like ChatGPT, is highlighted.\n\nEntities mentioned include:\n- Authors and researchers such as Radosvet Desislavov, Fernando Mart\u00ednez-Plumed, Jos\u00e9 Hern\u00e1ndez-Orallo, and others.\n- Journals and publications like \"Sustainable Computing: Informatics and Systems,\" \"World Development,\" and \"Cognitive Computation.\"\n- DOI links for accessing the studies and articles referenced. \n\nOverall, the section emphasizes the importance of addressing sustainability in AI development while considering ethical and social implications."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "5bbe2f3b-a5cf-473e-9e50-1d182dcad9fb", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\ADDRESSING THE SUSTAINABLE AI TRILEMMA A CASE STUDY ON LLM AGENTS AND RAG.md", "file_name": "ADDRESSING THE SUSTAINABLE AI TRILEMMA A CASE STUDY ON LLM AGENTS AND RAG.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 72913, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22"}, "hash": "47c48bbdebdc34c45547d1ddc9efb86758d4c6bea59cc0a6ae9786ef666e699e", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "fef2fd32-473a-4b2a-acd2-87013a3fbede", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\ADDRESSING THE SUSTAINABLE AI TRILEMMA A CASE STUDY ON LLM AGENTS AND RAG.md", "file_name": "ADDRESSIN