s of intelligent agents based on LLMs, indicating ongoing research in this area.\n\nEntities mentioned include various authors and their affiliations, as well as specific journals and conferences where the research is published. The references span a range of years, with a focus on recent studies from 2023 and 2024."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "5bbe2f3b-a5cf-473e-9e50-1d182dcad9fb", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\ADDRESSING THE SUSTAINABLE AI TRILEMMA A CASE STUDY ON LLM AGENTS AND RAG.md", "file_name": "ADDRESSING THE SUSTAINABLE AI TRILEMMA A CASE STUDY ON LLM AGENTS AND RAG.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 72913, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22"}, "hash": "47c48bbdebdc34c45547d1ddc9efb86758d4c6bea59cc0a6ae9786ef666e699e", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "97ea82e6-b2d4-4efb-8b35-1952c06235e7", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\ADDRESSING THE SUSTAINABLE AI TRILEMMA A CASE STUDY ON LLM AGENTS AND RAG.md", "file_name": "ADDRESSING THE SUSTAINABLE AI TRILEMMA A CASE STUDY ON LLM AGENTS AND RAG.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 72913, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22"}, "hash": "9404ffc9374fd37eec5dbad39a279eab6b6de5aeb038500257a3d232ba58debe", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "7af13721-a355-4e40-b4da-758e2e500e6a", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "16c710aea27885197537194a0bd6ecc4f649f70e0376d882d79060f0fa8c9044", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}