ting techniques for document ranking, indicating a trend towards leveraging LLMs for improved information retrieval.\n\nEntities mentioned include:\n- **Authors**: Nils Reimers, Iryna Gurevych, Shengyao Zhuang, Bing Liu, Bevan Koopman, Guido Zuccon, Xueguang Ma, Xinyu Zhang, Ronak Pradeep, Jimmy Lin, Devendra Sachan, Weiwei Sun, Zhen Qin.\n- **Conferences**: Proceedings of the Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing (EMNLP).\n- **Publications**: Various arXiv preprints and conference papers related to NLP advancements.\n\nOverall, the section emphasizes the ongoing research and developments in leveraging LLMs for enhancing search and retrieval processes in NLP."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "5bbe2f3b-a5cf-473e-9e50-1d182dcad9fb", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\ADDRESSING THE SUSTAINABLE AI TRILEMMA A CASE STUDY ON LLM AGENTS AND RAG.md", "file_name": "ADDRESSING THE SUSTAINABLE AI TRILEMMA A CASE STUDY ON LLM AGENTS AND RAG.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 72913, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22"}, "hash": "47c48bbdebdc34c45547d1ddc9efb86758d4c6bea59cc0a6ae9786ef666e699e", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "4d4601be-8ec3-422f-a259-df3545df2959", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\ADDRESSING THE SUSTAINABLE AI TRILEMMA A CASE STUDY ON LLM AGENTS AND RAG.md", "file_name": "ADDRESSING THE SUSTAINABLE AI TRILEMMA A CASE STUDY ON LLM AGENTS AND RAG.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 72913, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "