ross Healthcare, Finance, and Education\"", "section_summary": "The section discusses the process of Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) in dynamic AI systems, focusing on knowledge source selection, data integration, and output generation. Key topics include:\n\n1. **Knowledge Source Selection**: The coordinating agent selects appropriate retrieval options based on the query type.\n2. **Data Integration and LLM Synthesis**: Retrieved data is synthesized by a Large Language Model (LLM) to create a coherent response.\n3. **Output Generation**: The system delivers a concise, actionable answer, potentially including references to the sources used.\n\nKey features and advantages of this system include:\n- Centralized simplicity for easier design and maintenance.\n- Efficiency and resource optimization through fewer agents.\n- Dynamic routing for real-time query evaluation.\n- Versatility in supporting various data sources and APIs.\n- Suitability for simpler systems with defined tasks.\n\nA specific use case in customer support illustrates the workflow, detailing how the system processes a query about order delivery status through a single-agent workflow, including query evaluation, knowledge source selection, and information retrieval from databases and APIs."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "63cc26e7-3760-4de7-9cea-369ed82e58d6", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_name": "AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 104275, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-20"}, "hash": "42831f3d26ca4cfa6d94fdd9504869cdd0ae1fd50debb205f921f3f248abd7cc", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "44acfe8d-ed52-457f-8cc1-d23232e7509f", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_name": "AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 104275, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-20"}, "hash": "5b2756d122904208e044faf31261d87ad1b57439b78b6507252cf880f92b99ba", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "aa78a764-13ef-42b0-a3bf-eddd5d890d8d", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "2c5ec9e6c1b67708bd908da7f5e703a66398c56d3367a3945c3548ea607dddf0", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "2. Knowledge Source Selection: Based on the query\u2019s type, the coordinating agent chooses from a variety of retrieval options:\n---\n# 3. Data Integration and LLM Synthesis\n\nOnce the relevant data is retrieved from the chosen sources, it is passed to a Large Language Model (LLM). The LLM synthesizes the gathered information, integrating insights from multiple sources into a coherent and contextually relevant response.\n\n# 4. Output Generation\n\nFinally, the system delivers a comprehensive, user-facing answer that addresses the original query. This response is presented in an actionable, concise format and may optionally include references or citations to the sources used.\n\n|Input|Query|Prompt|Tools|\n|---|---|---|---|\n|Vector Search X|Data Sources|Retrieval|Vector Search Y|\n|Response|Router|Web Search| |\n\n# Key Features and Advantages\n\n- Centralized Simplicity: A single agent handles all retrieval and routing tasks, making the architecture straightforward to design, implement, and maintain.\n- Efficiency & Resource Optimization: With fewer agents and simpler coordination, the system demands fewer computational resources and can handle queries more quickly.\n- Dynamic Routing: The agent evaluates each query in real-time, selecting the most appropriate knowledge source (e.g., structured DB, semantic search, web search).\n- Versatility Across Tools: Supports a variety of data sources and external APIs, enabling both structured and unstructured workflows.\n- Ideal for Simpler Systems: Suited for applications with well-defined tasks or limited integration requirements (e.g., document retrieval, SQL-based workflows).\n---\n# Use Case: Customer Support\n\nPrompt: Can you tell me the delivery status of my order?\n\n# System Process (Single-Agent Workflow):\n\n1. Query Submission and Evaluation:\n- The user submits the query, which is received by the coordinating agent.\n- The coordinating agent analyzes the query and determines the most appropriate sources of information.\n2. Knowledge Source Selection:\n- Retrieves tracking details from the order management database.\n- Fetches real-time updates from the shipping provider\u2019s API.\n- Optionally conducts a web search to identify local conditions affecting delivery, such as weather or logistical delays.\n3.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 33071, "end_char_idx": 35332, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "[Excerpt from document]\n{metadata_str}\nExcerpt:\n-----\n{content}\n-----\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "aa78a764-13ef-42b0-a3bf-eddd5d890d8d", "embedding": [-0.03115219995379448, 0.03388630226254463, 0.04957287013530731, 0.014291900210082531, -0.002152415458112955, -0.0008185910410247743, -0.0027962413150817156, 0.016805065795779228, -0.0010088908020406961, 0.027479112148284912, 0.02847333252429962, -0.07268846780061722, -0.004684567451477051, -0.03261591121554375, -0.012441548518836498, -0.009244857355952263, -0.02772766724228859, -0.04498841613531113, -