 intelligent agents to enhance the quality and relevance of generated responses in dynamic AI systems. Key topics include:\n\n1. **Core Principle of Corrective RAG**: It focuses on dynamically evaluating retrieved documents, performing corrective actions, and refining queries to improve response quality.\n\n2. **Key Agents in the Workflow**:\n   - **Context Retrieval Agent**: Retrieves initial context documents.\n   - **Relevance Evaluation Agent**: Assesses document relevance and flags irrelevant ones.\n   - **Query Refinement Agent**: Optimizes queries for better retrieval results.\n   - **External Knowledge Retrieval Agent**: Conducts web searches for additional context when needed.\n   - **Response Synthesis Agent**: Compiles validated information into coherent responses.\n\n3. **Key Features and Advantages**:\n   - **Iterative Correction**: Enhances response accuracy by correcting irrelevant results.\n   - **Dynamic Adaptability**: Utilizes real-time searches and query refinement.\n   - **Agentic Modularity**: Each agent specializes in specific tasks for efficiency.\n   - **Factuality Assurance**: Validates content to reduce misinformation risks.\n\n4. **Use Case**: The section mentions an application of Corrective RAG as an academic research assistant, specifically inquiring about the latest findings in generative AI research. \n\nOverall, the section emphasizes the importance of agent-based systems in improving the accuracy and relevance of AI-generated responses across various domains."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "63cc26e7-3760-4de7-9cea-369ed82e58d6", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_name": "AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 104275, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-20"}, "hash": "42831f3d26ca4cfa6d94fdd9504869cdd0ae1fd50debb205f921f3f248abd7cc", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "6784f0aa-37c2-4231-9c1d-16d0ff332045", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_name": "AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 104275, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-20"}, "hash": "86f57b04f48b75578d3f3bc4fc8c4869f9538fe288222760f789b38dcf885036", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "a8c02690-b1b3-4a9b-b467-29ca18753551", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "261bf849bb4bcf6c35fb34400dff648bb20ba7988341dc9d081df4ed97438866", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "By embedding intelligent agents into the workflow, Corrective RAG ensures iterative refinement of context documents and responses, minimizing errors and maximizing relevance.\n\n# Key Idea of Corrective RAG:\n\nThe core principle of Corrective RAG lies in its ability to evaluate retrieved documents dynamically, perform corrective actions, and refine queries to enhance the quality of generated responses. Corrective RAG adjusts its approach as follows:\n\n- Document Relevance Evaluation: Retrieved documents are assessed for relevance by the Relevance Evaluation Agent. Documents below the relevance threshold trigger corrective steps.\n- Query Refinement and Augmentation: Queries are refined by the Query Refinement Agent, which leverages semantic understanding to optimize retrieval for better results.\n---\n# Overview of Agentic Corrective RAG\n\n\u2022 Dynamic Retrieval from External Sources: When context is insufficient, the External Knowledge Retrieval Agent performs web searches or accesses alternative data sources to supplement the retrieved documents.\n\n\u2022 Response Synthesis: All validated and refined information is passed to the Response Synthesis Agent for final response generation.\n\n# Workflow\n\nThe Corrective RAG system is built on five key agents:\n\n1. Context Retrieval Agent: Responsible for retrieving initial context documents from a vector database.\n2. Relevance Evaluation Agent: Assesses the retrieved documents for relevance and flags any irrelevant or ambiguous documents for corrective actions.\n3. Query Refinement Agent: Rewrites queries to improve retrieval, leveraging semantic understanding to optimize results.\n4. External Knowledge Retrieval Agent: Performs web searches or accesses alternative data sources when the context documents are insufficient.\n5. Response Synthesis Agent: Synthesizes all validated information into a coherent and accurate response.\n\n# Key Features and Advantages\n\n\u2022 Iterative Correction: Ensures high response accuracy by dynamically identifying and correcting irrelevant or ambiguous retrieval results.\n\n\u2022 Dynamic Adaptability: Incorporates real-time web searches and query refinement for enhanced retrieval precision.\n\n\u2022 Agentic Modularity: Each agent performs specialized tasks, ensuring efficient and scalable operation.\n\n\u2022 Factuality Assurance: By validating all retrieved and generated content, Corrective RAG minimizes the risk of hallucination or misinformation.\n---\n# Use Case: Academic Research Assistant\n\n# Prompt: What are the latest findings in generative AI research?", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 43824, "end_char_idx": 46355, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "[Excerpt from document]\n{metadata_str}\nExcerpt:\n-----\n{content}\n--