837815166, 0.00028723725699819624, 0.02869834378361702, 0.005949491634964943, 0.01299547590315342, -0.0082846162840724, -0.042560186237096786, -0.02586911991238594, -0.0011836374178528786, 0.02555776946246624, -0.051359206438064575, -0.023242950439453125, -0.028454678133130074, -0.001714116893708706, -0.027100982144474983, 0.0018782524857670069, -0.0030221249908208847, -0.02182157151401043, 0.0211041122674942, -0.007560389116406441], "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_name": "AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 104275, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-20", "document_title": "\"Agentic Retrieval-Augmented Generation: Principles, Architectures, Applications, and Future Directions in Dynamic AI Systems Across Healthcare, Finance, and Education\"", "section_summary": "The section discusses the concept of Adaptive Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), focusing on its principles, system architecture, and applications. Key topics include:\n\n1. **Core Principle**: Adaptive RAG dynamically tailors retrieval strategies based on the complexity of user queries.\n\n2. **Query Types**:\n   - **Straightforward Queries**: Fact-based questions answered directly using pre-existing knowledge.\n   - **Simple Queries**: Moderately complex tasks requiring minimal context, addressed through single-step retrieval.\n   - **Complex Queries**: Multi-layered questions needing iterative reasoning, handled via multi-step retrieval.\n\n3. **Workflow Components**:\n   - **Classifier Role**: A smaller language model predicts query complexity using automatically labeled datasets.\n   - **Dynamic Strategy Selection**: The system adjusts its approach based on query type, optimizing retrieval and response generation.\n   - **LLM Integration**: The language model synthesizes retrieved information into coherent responses, refining answers through iterative interactions.\n\n4. **Key Features and Advantages**:\n   - **Dynamic Adaptability**: Optimizes retrieval strategies for efficiency and accuracy.\n   - **Resource Efficiency**: Reduces unnecessary processing for simple queries while ensuring thorough analysis for complex ones.\n\nOverall, the section emphasizes the adaptability and efficiency of the Adaptive RAG system in handling various query complexities across different domains."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "63cc26e7-3760-4de7-9cea-369ed82e58d6", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_name": "AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 104275, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-20"}, "hash": "42831f3d26ca4cfa6d94fdd9504869cdd0ae1fd50debb205f921f3f248abd7cc", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "a8c02690-b1b3-4a9b-b467-29ca18753551", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_name": "AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 104275, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-20"}, "hash": "e33045c200fba58e15f21051c1cbf9c0568b0e8299509dfa46aa9e6230e44311", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "96cebf46-6731-43fc-9f28-86aa5a86628d", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "f859f56dbcf95ff344f67d99886439c5b04ec9266028d2d138df3ce188f81010", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "|Graph|Document|Questions|Answer|\n|---|---|---|---|\n|(Node)|relevant|Yes|Generate|\n|(Node)|Hallucination?|Yes|No|\n|Retrieve|(Node)|Query| |\n\n# Figure 20: An Overview of Adaptive Agentic RAG\n\n# Key Idea of Adaptive RAG\n\nThe core principle of Adaptive RAG lies in its ability to dynamically tailor retrieval strategies based on the complexity of the query. Adaptive RAG adjusts its approach as follows:\n---\n# Adaptive RAG System\n\n# Query Types\n\n- Straightforward Queries: For fact-based questions that require no additional retrieval (e.g., \"What is the boiling point of water?\"), the system directly generates an answer using pre-existing knowledge.\n- Simple Queries: For moderately complex tasks requiring minimal context (e.g., \"What is the status of my latest electricity bill?\"), the system performs a single-step retrieval to fetch the relevant details.\n- Complex Queries: For multi-layered queries requiring iterative reasoning (e.g., \"How has the population of City X changed over the past decade, and what are the contributing factors?\"), the system employs multi-step retrieval, progressively refining intermediate results to provide a comprehensive answer.\n\n# Workflow\n\nThe Adaptive RAG system is built on three primary components:\n\n1. Classifier Role:\n- A smaller language model analyzes the query to predict its complexity.\n- The classifier is trained using automatically labeled datasets, derived from past model outcomes and query patterns.\n2. Dynamic Strategy Selection:\n- For straightforward queries, the system avoids unnecessary retrieval, directly leveraging the LLM for response generation.\n- For simple queries, it employs a single-step retrieval process to fetch relevant context.\n- For complex queries, it activates multi-step retrieval to ensure iterative refinement and enhanced reasoning.\n3. LLM Integration:\n- The LLM synthesizes retrieved information into a coherent response.\n- Iterative interactions between the LLM and the classifier enable refinement for complex queries.\n\n# Key Features and Advantages\n\n- Dynamic Adaptability: Adjusts retrieval strategies based on query complexity, optimizing both computational efficiency and response accuracy.\n- Resource Efficiency: Minimizes unnecessary overhead for simple queries while ensuring thorough processing for complex ones.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 48148, "end_char_idx": 50452, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "[Excerpt from document]\n{metadata_str}\nExcerpt:\n-----\n{content}\n-----\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "96cebf46-6731-43fc-9f28-86aa5a86628d", "embedding": [-0.01809273473918438, 0.04482421278953552, 0.008788920938968658, 0.025544365867972374, -0.010662555694580078, -0.010068999603390694, -0.003110805992037058, 0.018350180238485336, 0.0041298633441329, 0.020938942208886147, 0.03169446438550949, -0.07219930738210678, -0.011978390626609325, -0.03678617626428604, -0.01199269387871027, 0.0025905505754053593, -0.022340593859553337, -0.04920079559087753, -0.020967548713088036, 0.0004961199010722339, 0.011520708911120892, 0.005556543357670307, 0.017220277339220047, 0.021139178425073624, -0.04576817899942398, -0.029019886627793312, 0.026760082691907883, 0.07917895168066025, -0.010197722353041172, -0.010540984570980072, 0.03175167366862297, -0.033525191247463226, 0.005567270331084728, -0.033582404255867004, 0.022211870178580284, 0.036585938185453415, -0.006092889234423637, -0.0075660524889826775, -0.002254440449178219, 0.03263843432068825, 0.011735247448086739, -0.023642126470804214, -0.006303851958364248, 0.05509344860911369, -0.016476545482873917, 0.015675602480769157, -0.004365855362266302, -0.016362125054001808, 0.027918590232729912, 0.041534624