ple queries while thoroughly addressing complex ones.\n2. **Enhanced Accuracy**: It emphasizes iterative refinement to ensure high precision in resolving complex queries.\n3. **Flexibility**: The architecture can be extended to include domain-specific tools and external APIs.\n\nA specific use case is presented for a customer support assistant, detailing a systematic process for handling complex queries about package delays. The adaptive RAG workflow includes:\n\n- **Query Classification**: Identifying the complexity of the query.\n- **Dynamic Strategy Selection**: Activating a multi-step retrieval process based on the query's complexity.\n- **Multi-Step Retrieval**: Gathering information from various sources, including order databases, shipping provider APIs, and web searches for external factors.\n- **Response Synthesis**: Integrating the retrieved information to provide a comprehensive response.\n\nAdditionally, the section introduces **Agent-G**, an agentic framework that combines graph knowledge bases with unstructured document retrieval to enhance RAG systems. This framework utilizes modular retriever banks, dynamic agent interactions, and feedback loops to improve reasoning and retrieval accuracy.\n\nOverall, the section highlights the efficiency, accuracy, and adaptability of Agentic RAG systems in various applications, particularly in customer support and knowledge integration."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "63cc26e7-3760-4de7-9cea-369ed82e58d6", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_name": "AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 104275, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-20"}, "hash": "42831f3d26ca4cfa6d94fdd9504869cdd0ae1fd50debb205f921f3f248abd7cc", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "aa176b1f-ac5c-49e6-93f8-4ab2c71c2fae", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_name": "AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 104275, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-20"}, "hash": "6c87f5ceddacf2f499dffcf73fe72d7e3c60f4d52bf92893421ba635248bbb84", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "2939ada4-3d75-459a-87dd-ef6d8bf3ba74", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "95976975012dc43ab6975b3d9d4914b04cb20acacf8eb970717a2bf3a11826c9", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "- Resource Efficiency: Minimizes unnecessary overhead for simple queries while ensuring thorough processing for complex ones.\n- Enhanced Accuracy: Iterative refinement ensures that complex queries are resolved with high precision.\n- Flexibility: Can be extended to incorporate additional pathways, such as domain-specific tools or external APIs.\n---\n# Use Case: Customer Support Assistant\n\nPrompt: Why is my package delayed, and what alternatives do I have?\n\n# System Process (Adaptive RAG Workflow):\n\n1. Query Classification:\n- The classifier analyzes the query and determines it to be complex, requiring multi-step reasoning.\n2. Dynamic Strategy Selection:\n- The system activates a multi-step retrieval process based on the complexity classification.\n3. Multi-Step Retrieval:\n- Retrieves tracking details from the order database.\n- Fetches real-time status updates from the shipping provider API.\n- Conducts a web search for external factors such as weather conditions or local disruptions.\n4. Response Synthesis:\n- The LLM integrates all retrieved information, synthesizing a comprehensive and actionable response.\n\n# Response:\n\nIntegrated Response: \u201cYour package is delayed due to severe weather conditions in your region. It is currently at the local distribution center and will be delivered in 2 days. Alternatively, you may opt for a local pickup from the facility.\u201d\n\n# 5.6 Graph-Based Agentic RAG\n\n# 5.6.1 Agent-G: Agentic Framework for Graph RAG\n\nAgent-G [8]: introduces a novel agentic architecture that integrates graph knowledge bases with unstructured document retrieval. By combining structured and unstructured data sources, this framework enhances retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) systems with improved reasoning and retrieval accuracy. It employs modular retriever banks, dynamic agent interaction, and feedback loops to ensure high-quality outputs as shown in Figure 21.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 50327, "end_char_idx": 52220, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "[Excerpt from document]\n{metadata_str}\nExcerpt:\n-----\n{content}\n-----\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "2939ada4-3d75-459a-87dd-ef6d8bf3ba74", "embedding": [-0.02211378514766693, 0.050598446279764175, 0.015519138425588608, 0.01902048848569393, -0.0001012417342280969, 0.005502120591700077, 0.0018674960592761636, 0.03701426461338997, -0.0041594975627958775, 0.025272898375988007, 0.031485818326473236, -0.08655967563390732, -0.026154816150665283, -0.024878008291125298, 0.0033006141893565655, 0.01018813718110323, -0.023548549041152, -0.05288880318403244, 0.013149804435670376, 0.0012356735533103347, 0.03288109228014946, 0.007627939805388451, -0.0014602667652070522, 0.037698738276958466, -0.026102164760231972, -0.030722366645932198, 0.021087074652314186, 0.06713113188743591, -0.00875337328761816, 0.0