that require interconnected data.\n\n4. **Use Case: Market Survey Generation** - GEAR synthesizes text, images, and videos for marketing campaigns, providing detailed reports on trends and customer preferences.\n\n5. **Key Benefits of GEAR**:\n   - Multi-Modal Capabilities: Combines various data types for comprehensive outputs.\n   - Enhanced Creativity: Fosters innovative ideas for marketing and entertainment.\n   - Dynamic Adaptability: Adjusts to changing market trends and customer needs.\n\n6. **Overall Impact** - Agentic RAG systems are versatile and transformative, addressing complex challenges in various industries, including personalized customer support, adaptive education, and multimodal workflows.\n\n7. **Tools and Frameworks** - The section concludes by highlighting the evolution of Agentic RAG systems and the tools available for developing these systems to meet real-world application needs. \n\nOverall, the section emphasizes the potential of Agentic RAG and GEAR in enhancing research, education, and marketing through advanced AI capabilities."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "63cc26e7-3760-4de7-9cea-369ed82e58d6", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_name": "AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 104275, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-20"}, "hash": "42831f3d26ca4cfa6d94fdd9504869cdd0ae1fd50debb205f921f3f248abd7cc", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "ec67c561-6dc2-4f9d-a748-866e3ac84aea", "node_type": "1", "me