es of code, where the system identified critical security vulnerabilities and performance issues, providing prioritized bug reports for developers.\n\nOverall, the section emphasizes the potential of AI and automation in enhancing software quality assurance processes."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "3cc7ef91-2447-4b5e-94de-b001d8d2b1ec", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AI-powered quality assurance Enhancing software infrastructure through intelligent.md", "file_name": "AI-powered quality assurance Enhancing software infrastructure through intelligent.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 46104, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-21"}, "hash": "b9c245bd83c39565a3f052f4561a0cd6704ad175466c1279d0e5edaf5b5d5406", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "ea599aa6-2d2a-468e-9ec0-a7e6e6c28d48", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AI-powered quality assurance Enhancing software infrastructure through intelligent.md", "file_name": "AI-powered quality assurance Enhancing software infrastructure through intelligent.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 46104, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-21"}, "hash": "bb003a266ac023151b8892e62282df0ac67f94d2a9c24771f1f31fb1ef39be7e", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "65ced2fe-733d-49e9-bb02-809823694a33", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "292a7bcf5cc9b2cf94fd2516a6edd7f1e2ff4a58ebcc9376d1eca6882debcaf2", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "non fault) are not in balance.\n\nF1-Score = 2 * Precision * Recall / Precision + Recall\n\n# 4.1.5. Example Calculation\n\nFor example, in a dataset of 1,000 software modules, the system detects 100 faults, with the following results:\n\nUsing the formulas above, we calculate:\n\n|Accuracy|80 + 850|930|0.93|\n|---|---|---|---|\n| |80 + 850 + 10 + 60|1,000| |\n|Precision|80|80|0.89|\n| |80 + 10|90| |\n|Recall|80|80|0.57|\n| |80 + 60|140| |\n|F1-Score|F1-Score = 2 * 0.89 * 0.57|0.69| |\n| |0.89 + 0.57| | |\n\nIn these values system is highly accurate with precision of 89% but could be improved from its recall side. The relatively lower recall implies the system skips a part of the errors that can be corrected with a more complex model.\n\n# 4.2. Comparative Analysis\n\nAn evaluation of the effectiveness of the proposed AI based QA system is done by a comparative study between the AI powered QA system and conventional fault detection methods. The machine learning models are contrasted to\n---\n# World Journal of Advanced Research and Reviews, 2024, 23(03), 3199-3213\n\n# 4.3. Case Studies or Examples\n\nTo demonstrate the effectiveness of the AI powered QA system further, a few case studies are presented on how the system was used on real world projects.\n\n# 4.3.1. Case Study 1: Large-Scale Web Application\n\nThe AI powered system tested a major web application, with over 500,000 lines of code. This revealed a number of critical faults associated with security vulnerabilities (e.g. SQL injection points) as well as backend code performance bottlenecks. Apart from fault detection, the system provided developers with prioritized bug reports and hence prioritized which steps to take on bug mentions first.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 34430, "end_char_idx": 36125, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "[Excerpt from document]\n{metadata_str}\nExcerpt:\n-----\n{content}\n-----\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__typ