nce Enhancing software infrastructure through intelligent.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 46104, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-21", "document_title": "\"Transforming Software Quality Assurance: Leveraging AI and Automation for Intelligent Fault Detection and Proactive Testing in Modern Development\"", "section_summary": "The section primarily discusses various resources and research related to software quality assurance, artificial intelligence, and cybersecurity. Key topics include:\n\n1. **Test Data Management**: Reference to best practices for managing test data, highlighting the importance of effective data handling in software testing.\n\n2. **Log Analysis**: Mention of Elasticsearch and the ELK Stack for real-time log analysis, emphasizing the role of these tools in monitoring and analyzing system performance.\n\n3. **Artificial Intelligence in Quality Assurance**: A citation of a research paper by Santhosh Bussa that explores the application of AI in enhancing software quality assurance processes.\n\n4. **Risk-Based Alerting**: Research by Chandrashekar and Jangampet on improving attack scenario monitoring in enterprise security through adaptive risk scoring.\n\n5. **Proactive Defense in Cybersecurity**: Another study by the same authors comparing honeypots with traditional anomaly detection methods in cybersecurity.\n\n6. **Network Security Tools**: A comprehensive review by Eemani on various network security tools, indicating a focus on the evolving landscape of network protection.\n\n7. **Big Data Analytics and Network Optimization**: Eemani's work on the integration of big data analytics techniques in network optimization and the current trends in network security.\n\n8. **Deep Learning in AI and Big Data**: A study by Eemani on the utilization of deep learning within the realms of artificial intelligence and big data.\n\nOverall, the section highlights the intersection of AI, software quality assurance, and cybersecurity, showcasing various studies and resources that contribute to these fields."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "3cc7ef91-2447-4b5e-94de-b001d8d2b1ec", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AI-powered quality assurance Enhancing software infrastructure through intelligent.md", "file_name": "AI-powered quality assurance Enhancing software infrastructure through intelligent.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 46104, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-21"}, "hash": "b9c245bd83c39565a3f052f4561a0cd6704ad175466c1279d0e5edaf5b5d5406", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "91beaa19-673f-40d0-bd71-9aa5a5729617", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AI-powered quality assurance Enhancing software infrastructure through intelligent.md", "file_name": "AI-powered quality assurance Enhancing software infrastructure through intelligent.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 46104, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-21"}, "hash": "61f83f58894a860bd0d05490a846577bdf079f08df43411868d185c173fb6a8f", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "a39d814e-ca8b-4c82-894a-0e2e4920daaf", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "1ab09d1b75754ffa577d51d42ebcfd4956405af18941774a87d19a69454f240f", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "TestRail. (n.d.). Best practices for managing test data. Retrieved from https://www.testrail.com\n14. Elasticsearch. (n.d.). Real-time log anal