cs include:\n\n1. **AI Application in Historical Research**: The focus is on utilizing AI for generating biographies, which is a specialized form of summarization in historical contexts.\n2. **Challenges in Biography Generation**: The system addresses issues such as maintaining historical writing styles, ensuring factual accuracy, and managing fragmented information from various sources.\n3. **System Features**:\n   - **Knowledge Graph (KG)**: Used for retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) to improve reference accuracy.\n   - **Chunking Strategy**: An in-context learning approach for efficient information processing.\n   - **Multi-Agent System**: Conducts real-time hallucination detection and error correction.\n   - **Fine-Tuning LLMs**: A two-step training process that combines data augmentation and stylistic optimization to teach language style.\n4. **Performance Improvements**: AIstorian shows significant enhancements in factual accuracy (3.8\u00d7 improvement) and a reduction in hallucination rates (47.6% decrease) compared to existing models.\n5. **Availability**: The data and code for AIstorian are accessible on GitHub.\n\nEntities involved include the authors Fengyu Li, Yilin Li, Junhao Zhu, Lu Chen, Yanfei Zhang, Jia Zhou, Hui Zu, Jingwen Zhao, and Yunjun Gao, affiliated with Zhejiang University and Huawei's Poisson Lab."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "86d6a30b-f854-412f-bc3d-7186c1cd0752", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_name": "AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 27860, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22"}, "hash": "13c05f2b3c34a30ab2b06b824e9bb3dd58f7f63367e6cdae60eac9f97a72c8ac", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "7ca539f4-6e4a-4cda-a98f-b1f0a75cd382", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "dcc84ca18bf9892bf73787ef55fc0c1cf521280500409c048d6772454e50a626", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "# AIstorian lets AI be a historian: A KG-powered multi-agent system for accurate biography generation\n\n# Fengyu Li\u2020, Yilin Li\u2020, Junhao Zhu\u2020, Lu Chen\u2020, Yanfei Zhang\u2020, Jia Zhou\u2020, Hui Zu\u2020, Jingwen Zhao\u2021, Yunjun Gao\u2020\n\n# \u2020Zhejiang University, \u2021Poisson Lab, Huawei\n\n{fengyuli, zhujunhao, luchen, yanfei.zhang, 0012802, zdzh, gaoyj}@zju.edu.cn,\nyilin.23@intl.zju.edu.cn, jingwenzhao5@huawei.com\n\n# Abstract\n\nHuawei has always been committed to exploring the AI application in historical research. Biography generation, as a specialized form of abstractive summarization, plays a crucial role in historical research but faces unique challenges that existing large language models (LLMs) struggle to address. These challenges include maintaining stylistic adherence to historical writing conventions, ensuring factual fidelity, and handling fragmented information across multiple documents. We present AIstorian, a novel end-to-end agentic system featured with a knowledge graph (KG)-powered retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) and anti-hallucination multi-agents. Specifically, AIstorian introduces an in-context learning based chunking strategy and a KG-based index for accurate and efficient reference retrieval. Meanwhile, AIstorian orchestrates multi-agents to conduct on-the-fly hallucination detection and error-type-aware correction. Additionally, to teach LLMs a certain language style, we finetune LLMs based on a two-step training approach combining data augmentation-enhanced supervised fine-tuning with stylistic preference optimization. Extensive experiments on a real-life historical Jinshi dataset demonstrate that AIstorian achieves a 3.8\u00d7 improvement in factual accuracy and a 47.6% reduction in hallucination rate compared to existing baselines. The data and code are available at: https://github.com/ZJU-DAILY/AIstorian.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 1832, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "[Excerpt from document]\n{metadata_str}\nExcerpt:\n-----\n{content}\n-----\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "7ca539f4-6e4a-4cda-a98f-b1f0a75cd382", "embedding": [-0.01927274465560913, 0.01398697029799223, 0.018676400184631348, -0.0015687905251979828, -0.006319210398942232, -0.018988125026226044, -0.007718584965914488, 0.025195522233843803, -0.039440006017684937, 0.05478230118751526, 0.006607217248529196, -0.06646521389484406, -0.01247578114271164, -0.013492276892066002, -0.016385897994041443, 0.03873523324728012, -0.03775940090417862, 0.009710915386676788, 0.009588935412466526, -0.0017822545487433672, 0.039982136338949203, 0.004967271815985441, 0.027662215754389763, 0.015572702512145042, 0.01364813931286335, -0.028245005756616592, -0.018730614334344864, 0.024002835154533386, 0.008369142189621925, -0.016589198261499405, -0.006671595387160778, -0.020221473649144173, -0.014447781257331371, 0.006735973060131073, -0.018500208854675293, 0.05505336821079254, 0.035563770681619644, -0.00846401508897543, 0.037325695157051086, -0.005875340662896633, 0.01595219410955906, -0.050906065851449966, 0.002771642990410328, 0.02722851186990738, -0.03377474099397659, 0.015477829612791538, 0.010829059407114983, 0.05529732629656792, 0.014312248677015305, 0.04461735114455223, -0.08061482757329941, -0.022566188126802444, -0.02641531638801098, -0.01494925282895565, -0.018432442098855972, -0.005627993959933519, 0.01790386438369751, -0.0206280704587698, 0.00633276347