e potential of LLMs in abstractive summarization and biography generation, highlighting their superior performance in recent studies.\n4. **Unique Characteristics of Biography Generation**: The section emphasizes the distinct challenges of biography writing, particularly the need for stylistic adherence to specific language styles and professional terminology, which LLMs may struggle to maintain.\n\nEntities mentioned include:\n- **Authors**: Fengyu Li, Yilin Li, Junhao Zhu, Lu Chen, Yanfei Zhang, Jia Zhou, Hui Zu, Jingwen Zhao, Yunjun Gao.\n- **Institution**: Huawei, in partnership with museums.\n- **Publication**: Reference to a conference paper and a GitHub repository for data and code related to AIstorian."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "86d6a30b-f854-412f-bc3d-7186c1cd0752", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_name": "AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 27860, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22"}, "hash": "13c05f2b3c34a30ab2b06b824e9bb3dd58f7f63367e6cdae60eac9f97a72c8ac", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "557ca41a-08b4-44ed-8b5d-ad9af61a23de", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_name": "AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 27860, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22"}, "hash": "d7350158a47f0849446e6aeb2db0cb1b3b9f79439f25580474f7c501a463b94b", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "fad4bcb8-2a2a-4e4e-acf3-1ee34aaf632d", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "6f3cd21ed49f04fc9755f67c1867552ded4404e03f8898794995b5f3a060bd62", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "The data and code are available at: https://github.com/ZJU-DAILY/AIstorian.\n\n# ACM Reference Format:\n\nFengyu Li\u2020, Yilin Li\u2020, Junhao Zhu\u2020, Lu Chen\u2020, Yanfei Zhang\u2020, Jia Zhou\u2020, Hui Zu\u2020, Jingwen Zhao\u2021, Yunjun Gao\u2020. 2018. AIstorian lets AI be a historian: A KG-powered multi-agent system for accurate biography generation. In Proceedings of Make sure to enter the correct conference title from your rights confirmation email (Conference acronym \u2019XX). ACM, New York, NY, USA, 6 pages. https://doi.org/XXXXXXX.XXXXXXX\n\n# 1 Introduction\n\nHuawei has a commercial partnership with several museums, exploring the application of AI in the management of historical documents. Biography generation is an important intersection of AI and history. Typically, biography writing relies heavily on the domain expertise of historians who carefully gather and summarize diverse historical materials. The development of automatic biography generation can free historians from tedious tasks of reading and writing materials. Biography generation automatically writes a concise document comprising a series of facts and events (e.g., date and place of birth and death, career, etc.) that builds a professional image for a person\u2019s life, by extracting and rephrasing biographical events based on references (e.g., textbooks).\n\nBiography generation can be considered a special form of abstractive summarization [20]. Recent studies [18,20] have demonstrated the superior performance of LLMs for abstractive summarization, manifesting significant 