3629508018494, -0.010698208585381508, 0.0283602736890316, -0.024291837587952614], "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_name": "AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 27860, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22", "document_title": "\"AIstorian: A Knowledge Graph-Driven Multi-Agent System for Accurate Biography Generation and Error Correction in Historical Research\"", "section_summary": "The section discusses the development of \"AIstorian,\" a multi-agent system designed for generating accurate biographies and correcting errors in historical research using a knowledge graph. Key topics include:\n\n1. **Biographical Information**: The section provides examples of historical figures, including their names, styles, and official career paths, highlighting the importance of accurate biographical data.\n\n2. **Stylistic Preference Optimization (StylePO)**: The use of the SimPO algorithm for fine-tuning a language model (LLM) to enhance factual fidelity and align with a classical Chinese language style. This involves training the model with expert-written biographies as positive samples and modified translations as negative samples.\n\n3. **Online Biography Generation**: The challenges of generating biographies with LLMs, including the tendency for the model to produce plausible but inaccurate content (hallucinations) and the cascading effect of errors in auto-regressive outputs.\n\n4. **Error Correction Mechanism**: The AIstorian system employs seven agents, including a Verifier, Router, and five Solvers, to automatically identify and correct errors during the biography generation process.\n\n5. **Verifier Role**: The Verifier checks the accuracy of \"atomic facts\" (individual pieces of biographical information) against retrieved references to ensure the reliability of the generated content.\n\nOverall, the section emphasizes the integration of advanced algorithms and multi-agent systems to enhance the accuracy and stylistic quality of biographical generation in historical research."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "86d6a30b-f854-412f-bc3d-7186c1cd0752", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_name": "AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 27860, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22"}, "hash": "13c05f2b3c34a30ab2b06b824e9bb3dd58f7f63367e6cdae60eac9f97a72c8ac", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "06a90c63-4a41-4a2c-9ec2-f104b518792e", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_name": "AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 27860, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22"}, "hash": "20c063bcd982042218ebd982c011d783d2347f70308c654c4573f74bf5e9eb45", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "60ec944f-82f4-4e81-a1cd-65955a4723d6", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "f9df911441d59914826b8ba52b9e304914d9801aed3d61700cb5536f19d0d358", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "<official career path>.\n\n\u6c6a\u6da6\u4e4b\uff0c \u5b57\u96e8\u5143\uff0c \u53f7\u542c\u822b\uff0c \u6d59\u6c5f\u94b1\u5858\u4eba\u3002 \u6563\u9986\u6388\u7f16\u4fee\uff0c\u5b98\u81f3\u5c11\u8a79\u4e8b\u3002\n\nHong Yao, styled Jingxin, nicknamed Shouyu, from Xin Cheng, Zhejiang. <official career path>.\n\n\u6d2a\u71ff\uff0c \u5b57\u955c\u5fc3\uff0c \u53f7\u5b88\u611a\uff0c \u6d59\u6c5f\u65b0\u57ce\u4eba\u3002 \u6563\u9986\u6539\u540f\u90e8\u4e3b\u4e8b,\u5b98\u81f3\u5e7f\u897f\u5de6\u6c5f\u9053\u3002\n\n# Stylistic preference optimization (StylePO)\n\nTo further align the LLM with preferences for high factual fidelity and a classical Chinese language style, we adopt the SimPO algorithm [14] to proceed fine-tuning the base model. The training set consists of pairs of positive and negative samples. In our setting, each positive sample is a golden biography written by experts in classical Chinese, while each negative sample is generated by translating the positive sample into modern Chinese and adding (or removing) additional details to (or from) the biography. SimPO steers the LLM to more likely generate biographies whose style resembles the expert-written ground truth.\n\n# 2.3.2 Online biography generation\n\nOffline model re-training improves generation quality, but it is inevitable that the LLM will output plausible content due to its inherent hallucination nature. Moreover, since LLMs output in an auto-regressive manner, errors in LLM outputs have a cascading effect, where one error results in further errors in LLM generation [4]. Therefore, error correction should be executed alongside biography generation. To this end, AIstorian orchestrates seven agents to automatically discover and fix errors during LLM generation. The multi-agents consist of a Verifier, a Router, and five Solvers.\n\n# Verifier\n\nFollowing prior work [16], we define the \u201catomic fact\u201d as a short sentence conveying one piece of biographical information. The core logic of the Verifier is to check whether each atomic fact in the generation can be supported by the retrieved references.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 9184, "end_char_idx": 10952, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "[Excerpt from document]\n{metadata_str}\nExcerpt:\n-----\n{content}\n-----\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "60ec944f-82f4-4e81-a1cd-65955a4723d6", "embedding": [-0.03064649924635887, 0.032177381217479706, 0.0060657537542283535, -0.006123522762209177, -0.005650538485497236, -0.011806556954979897, -0.013034150004386902, 0.0266893170773983, -0.021995577961206436, 0.06337268650531769, 0.025822781026363373, -0.06735875457525253, -0.03226403519511223, -0.019193777814507484, -0.02267436496913433, 0.02017585188150406, -0.014312290586531162, 0.022515499964356422, -0.012203719466924667, 0.02042137086391449, 0.06273722648620605, 0.009199726395308971, 0.03526802733540535, 0.015626536682248116, 0.02583722211420536, -0.030530961230397224, 0.006777035538107157, 0.04835272207856178, 0.016478631645441055, -0.02312207594513893, 0.017778435721993446, -0.026270492002367973, -0.020349159836769104, 0.005275039467960596, -0.03411264345049858, 0.04705291986465454, 0.030126577243208885, -0.03009769320487976, 0.004664853680878878, -0.006621781270951033, 0.011987085454165936, -0.057220276445150375, -0.011272192932665348, 0.01670970767736435, -0.05268540605902672, 0.0021735618356615305, -0.0015498362481594086, 0.03934074565768242, 0.0012158587342128158, 0.02382974699139595, -0.0725579708814621, -0.009813522920012474, -0.01487553957849741, -0.008990313857793808, 0.010954462923109531, 0.017648454755544662, 0.008130998350679874, -0.010066263377666473, -0.006744540762156248, -0.006202955264598131, 0.034141529351472855, -0.010607847943902016, 0.00654956977814436, 0.042575813829898834, -0.06175515055656433, -0.009596888907253742, -0.030790921300649643, 0.023945285007357597, -0.051847752183675766, 0.0001672144135227427, 0.008744794875383377, 0.012738083489239216, -0.014247300103306