ed multi-agent system.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 27860, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22", "document_title": "\"AIstorian: A Knowledge Graph-Driven Multi-Agent System for Accurate Biography Generation and Error Correction in Historical Research\"", "section_summary": "The section discusses the AIstorian, a knowledge graph (KG)-powered multi-agent system designed for generating accurate historical biographies and correcting errors in historical research. Key topics include:\n\n1. **System Overview**: AIstorian utilizes a KG-powered retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) mechanism and employs multiple agents to enhance biography generation.\n2. **Research Findings**: The paper presents findings from ablation studies indicating that while multi-agent systems can reduce hallucination rates, they may negatively affect creativity, as measured by ROUGE scores.\n3. **Significance**: This work is noted as the first to generate historical biographies from a large corpus, demonstrating significant improvements in biography quality and a reduction in hallucinations.\n4. **Authors and Affiliations**: The authors include Sewon Min, Kalpesh Krishna, Xinxi Lyu, Mike Lewis, Wen-tau Yih, Pang Koh, and Fengyu Li, with Fengyu Li being an intern at Huawei and a graduate student at Zhejiang University.\n5. **Company Background**: Huawei is highlighted as a leader in ICT solutions, focusing on digital transformation and innovation through cloud computing, AI, and big data.\n\nThe section also includes references to related works and tools in the field of natural language processing and knowledge-grounded models."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "86d6a30b-f854-412f-bc3d-7186c1cd0752", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_name": "AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 27860, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22"}, "hash": "13c05f2b3c34a30ab2b06b824e9bb3dd58f7f63367e6cdae60eac9f97a72c8ac", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "c2f9af7d-f997-4c92-a96f-ae5ce7e619bf", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_name": "AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 27860, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22"}, "hash": "2226dffe52b1f85441719422063b986a07891b328c00425896b709716ef00525", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "38613ccd-a9b6-4ca0-a4b0-0e91440dc984", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "a2557832c2b715f59a7fba07c227cdc2142abfec7ad9e93cdda400a270e64c05", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "In addition, we show that each component plays different roles according to ablation studies. For example, multi-agents improve hallucination rates but negatively impact creativity (measured by ROUGE scores).\n\n# 4 Conclusion\n\nIn this paper, we propose AIstorian, an innovative KG-powered multi-agent system towards accurate historical biography generation, which is featured with a KG-powered RAG mechanism and error-aware biography generation with multi-agents. To the best of our knowledge, this is the first work to generate historical biographies from a massive corpus. The experimental results demonstrate that our system significantly improves the quality of biography generation and alleviates hallucinations.\n---\n# AIstorian lets AI be a historian: A KG-powered multi-agent system for accurate biography generation\n\n# Conference acronym \u2019XX, June 03\u201305, 2018, Woodstock, NY\n\n# Presenter & Company Biography\n\nSewon Min, Kalpesh Krishna, Xinxi Lyu, Mike Lewis, Wen-tau Yih, Pang Koh, Fengyu Li is currently an intern at Huawei and a graduate student in the Software Engineering at Zhejiang University. His research interests mainly focus on RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) and natural language processing.\n\nHuawei is a global leader in information and communications technology (ICT) solutions. It offers comprehensive services and solutions to help enterprises and developers achieve digital transformation and innovation, with its strong technical capabilities in cloud computing, AI, and big data.\n\n# References\n\n1. Jiahuan Cao, Dezhi Peng, Peirong Zhang, Yongxin Shi, Yang Liu, Kai Ding, and Lianwen Jin. 2024. TongGu: Mastering Classical Chinese Understanding with Knowledge-Grounded Large Language Models. arXiv preprint arXiv:2407.03937 (2024).\n2. Harrison Chase. 2022. LangChain. https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchain\n3. Tong Chen, Hongwei Wang, Sihao Chen, Wenhao Yu, Kaixin Ma, Xinran Zhao, Hongming Zhang, and Dong Yu. 2024.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 16439, "end_char_idx": 18389, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "[Excerpt from document]\n{metadata_str}\nExcerpt:\n-----\n{content}\n-----\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "38613ccd-a9b6-4ca0-a4b0-0e91440dc984", "embedding": [-0.03127775713801384, 0.021683353930711746, 0.01953146606683731, 0.006709229666739702, 0.006352866068482399, 0.0037658035289496183, -0.005691537633538246, 0.052248384803533554, -0.06370684504508972, 0.029386289417743683, 0.016721675172448158, -0.03130517154932022, -0.027481114491820335, 0.012184892781078815, -0.004310628864914179, 0.