 Source Material**: AIstorian is noted for its high fidelity to historical details and stylistic consistency, while Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct, despite being more fluent, often introduces inaccuracies and fabricated content.\n\n2. **Error Categorization**: The section uses color coding to indicate different types of errors in the biographies produced: \n   - Blue for \"Not included\" errors,\n   - Red for \"Not supported\" errors,\n   - Cyan for content overlooked by historians.\n\n3. **Qualitative Analysis**: Table 3 presents a qualitative analysis of biographies, showcasing the differences in accuracy and reliability between the two systems.\n\n4. **Historical Context**: The excerpt includes a brief biography of Hu E, a historical figure from the Ming dynasty, providing context for the analysis.\n\nOverall, the section emphasizes the importance of accuracy in historical research and the potential of AI technologies like AIstorian to enhance this accuracy."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "86d6a30b-f854-412f-bc3d-7186c1cd0752", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_name": "AIstorian lets AI be a historian A KG-powered multi-agent system.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 27860, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-22"}, "hash": "13c05f2b3c34a30ab2b06b824e9bb3dd58f7f63367e6cdae60eac9f97a72c8ac", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "79ff1081-561f-4a55-b857-73f177675dea", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\