s and Humanities, International Journal of Scientific Research in Computer Science, Engineering and Information Technology, International Journal of Scientific Research in Civil Engineering, Eduzone, Stallion Journal for Multidisciplinary Associated Research Studies.\n- Topics: SQL BI optimization, data integration techniques, big data analytics, automation in QA, and AI in automated testing environments. \n\nOverall, the section highlights the evolving landscape of software quality assurance through the lens of advanced technologies and research contributions."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "f30f272f-f44c-45fa-a7a9-1bbf727c984d", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\Artificial Intelligence in Quality Assurance for Software Systems.md", "file_name": "Artificial Intelligence in Quality Assurance for Software Systems.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 46770, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-21"}, "hash": "5dbad9039ae67ed68798be7d57a52b3f05b9390adf56748e90646287c8345de5", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "21817837-045b-48d7-901a-13d69d6788f7", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\Artificial Intelligence in Quality Assurance for Software Systems.md", "file_name": "Artificial Intelligence in Quality Assurance for Software Systems.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 46770, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-21"}, "hash": "fcfccc22df76ba14269b755e8d35bd6436344018fbb87ed55834340b5244c2a6", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node