) for AI/ML in CSV, expected by 2028.\n\n4. **Compliance Costs**: Early adopters of these evolving standards may incur additional costs of 20\u201330%.\n\nOverall, the section highlights the anticipated regulatory changes, their implications for compliance, and the challenges faced by organizations in adapting to these new standards."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "809e2f15-9b79-4079-99f3-502b5a7460da", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\Automating FDA Compliance The Role of AI in Computer System Validation (CSV).md", "file_name": "Automating FDA Compliance The Role of AI in Computer System Validation (CSV).md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 28995, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-21"}, "hash": "d58983ff8dd6a77cba1c06de0a3228d022c3c3417bc54f5df490d834982f4c13", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "96003ef4-9261-4b20-a660-1815d180d8a1", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\Automating FDA Compliance The Role of AI in Computer System Validation (CSV).md", "file_name": "Automating FDA Compliance The Role of AI in Computer System Validation (CSV).md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 28995, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-21"}, "hash": "7929f66336bcd3bb766c65804d505a3b14db19eb97e629306d8b3f89e0fb12c0", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "3ad82041-4660-4b55-bdc7-072175ce4493", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "3269210a94f8d5b6cd44ebb7db49502f374ea2c3b2cc7c89761e61eb015f2bcf", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}