 and journals that contribute to the understanding of AI and NLP applications in healthcare. The section highlights the current status, challenges, and potential future opportunities for these technologies in medical applications."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "dad35ff1-58aa-45cb-b326-0446ff627bda", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\Chatbots and Their Applications in Medical Fields Current Status.md", "file_name": "Chatbots and Their Applications in Medical Fields Current Status.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 28958, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-23"}, "hash": "4d0315e8f144da5f7f359eae5fa855cbb6e34f8f15c19f56fd0a30b52a22b7b2", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "c45f188a-c513-446d-a8e0-d74e4411705a", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\Chatbots and Their Applications in Medical Fields Current Status.md", "file_name": "Chatbots and Their Applications in Medical Fields Current Status.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 28958, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-23"}, "hash": "91dc0d85e4a25f98a7deecaf37f5c3c2a0bc5bb7747a7b947e4a475f8667953f", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "77211096-7ae8-46c0-be35-2f18425af6d0", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "e3bebe35adb5a32c0de1e152e9863016e69007dc090f4680851c518ccb2e36c3", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "Adverse drug event detection using natural language processing: a scoping 