ure roles of ChatGPT and similar AI technologies in psychiatric practice, as explored by Cheng et al. (2023).\n\n4. **AI and Chatbots in Psychiatry**: The integration of AI and chatbots in psychiatric care, discussed by Pham et al. (2022).\n\n5. **AI in Infectious Disease**: The potential applications of AI, using ChatGPT as a case study, in managing infectious diseases, as presented by Cheng et al. (2023).\n\n6. **Reflections on Mpox Outbreak**: Insights and suggestions from AI perspectives regarding the Mpox outbreak in 2022, also by Cheng et al. (2023).\n\nOverall, the section emphasizes the growing significance of AI and chatbots in various medical domains, highlighting current research and future opportunities."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "dad35ff1-58aa-45cb-b326-0446ff627bda", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\Chatbots and Their Applications in Medical Fields Current Status.md", "file_name": "Chatbots and Their Applications in Medical Fields Current Status.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 28958, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-23"}, "hash": "4d0315e8f144da5f7f359eae5fa855cbb6e34f8f15c19f56fd0a30b52a22b7b2", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "9845cc6c-7638-40e7-a52a-f616aac1e6a3", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\Chatbots and Their Applications in Medical Fields Current Status.md", "file_name": "Chatbots and Their Applications in Medical Fields Current Status.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 28958, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "las