900238096714, -0.003955623134970665, 0.015425939112901688, -0.04182319715619087, 0.01178425457328558, -0.012359256856143475, -0.006387819070369005, 0.008433375507593155, -0.010911836288869381, 0.018096067011356354, 0.019206417724490166], "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\Chatbots and Their Applications in Medical Fields Current Status.md", "file_name": "Chatbots and Their Applications in Medical Fields Current Status.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 28958, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-23", "document_title": "\"Advancing Healthcare: A Comprehensive Review of Chatbots and AI in Medical Applications, Trends, Challenges, and Future Opportunities\"", "section_summary": "The section provides a list of references related to the development and application of chatbots and artificial intelligence (AI) in the medical field. Key topics include:\n\n1. **Technical Development of Chatbots**: The technical aspects and metrics for evaluating healthcare chatbots are discussed, highlighting the importance of scoping reviews in understanding their development.\n\n2. **AI Applications in Healthcare**: The use of AI during the COVID-19 pandemic and its role in promoting physical activity, healthy diets, and weight loss are examined.\n\n3. **Effectiveness of AI in Medical Education**: Studies are referenced that assess the effectiveness of AI-powered chatbots in responding to medical exam questions, particularly in orthopaedics.\n\n4. **AI and Medical Examinations**: The ability of AI, specifically ChatGPT, to pass medical board examinations is explored, comparing its performance to that of orthopaedic residents.\n\nKey entities mentioned include:\n- Journals: Annals of Biomedical Engineering, Journal of Medical Internet Research, International Journal of Behavioral Nutrition and Physical Activity, Clinical Orthopaedics and Related Research.\n- Authors: Safi Z, Abd-Alrazaq A, Vaishya R, Oh YJ, and others involved in the research and publication of these studies.\n\nOverall, the section emphasizes the growing integration of AI and chatbots in healthcare, their evaluation, and their potential impact on medical education and patient care."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "dad35ff1-58aa-45cb-b326-0446ff627bda", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\Chatbots and Their Applications in Medical Fields Current Status.md", "file_name": "Chatbots and Their Applications in Medical Fields Current Status.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 28958, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-23"}, "hash": "4d0315e8f144da5f7f359eae5fa855cbb6e34f8f15c19f56fd0a30b52a22b7b2", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "f6bb0c71-c6f5-42cd-b735-816762f3099b", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\Chatbots and Their Applications in Medical Fields Current Status.md", "file_name": "Chatbots and Their Applications in Medical Fields Current Status.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 28958, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-23"}, "hash": "f7c0ad283bd51bd626f557d576964bd9c79aee8f089ab75414f1499dbfcfcde3", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "c71cd547-ff4f-43f3-8a9b-a7d3c1b7537a", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "272da4f7dcc0c4dee038817a528f55af8d7c7a8d2967a80e821166fdf67c9d02", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "Ann Biomed Eng. 2023;51(5):870\