cesses.\n\n2. **Computer System Validation**: The regulation surrounding computer system validation is described as both general and specific, mandating the validation of critical procedures and the education of personnel involved.\n\n3. **Regulatory Bodies and Guidelines**: The excerpt references various regulatory bodies, including the US FDA and EU legislation, which provide recommendations for implementing validation processes. The ISPE GAMP5 manual is highlighted as a significant resource for interpreting regulatory requirements and establishing quality systems for computer systems validation.\n\n4. **Quality Models**: The text mentions the development of quality models that transition from legal requirements to practical frameworks for computer systems in the pharmaceutical sector.\n\nEntities mentioned include:\n- **Borut Rusjan, PhD**: Author and professor at the University of Ljubljana.\n- **International Society for Pharmaceutical Engineering (ISPE)**: Organization that developed the GAMP5 manual.\n- **Regulatory Bodies**: US FDA and EU legislation.\n\nOverall, the excerpt underscores the critical role of computer system validation and quality management in ensuring data integrity and compliance within the pharmaceutical industry."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "2f2b69d9-5dae-4221-9dcb-f2fbedd34145", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\COMPUTER SYSTEM VALIDATION EXAMPLE OF QUALITY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM.md", "file_name": "COMPUTER SYSTEM VALIDATION EXAMPLE OF QUALITY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 53509, "creation_date": "2025-03-26", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-21"},