fined in the URS [R1], at this stage, we need to review of whether the design documentation provided by the supplier actually covers all of our URS requirements. This is important, as the supplier will build the computer system exactly as it has been defined in FS, SDS and HDS. After completing the comparison between the URS and the FS, SDS and HDS, appointed responsible persons approve the record that was created, when review of the documents was conducted.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 25832, "end_char_idx": 27829, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "[Excerpt from document]\n{metadata_str}\nExcerpt:\n-----\n{content}\n-----\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "cf49f1c3-a854-441f-8b0b-51d4f44ba67d", "embedding": [-0.030371161177754402, 0.062022723257541656, 0.04010222479701042, -0.013418624177575111, -0.009065253660082817, -0.04483971372246742, 0.013264975510537624, 0.012119014747440815, 0.00996793806552887, 0.059974078088998795, 0.05572314187884331, -0.011165115050971508, -0.07974350452423096, -0.000568979128729552, 0.020563272759318352, -0.014570986852049828, -0.0034090732224285603, 0.007759242784231901, 0.0004205323930364102, -0.0006498045404441655, 0.08127998560667038, 0.04289350286126137, 0.01950053870677948, 0.026555560529232025, -0.023136883974075317, -0.07933377474546432, 0.011305958963930607, 0.025492824614048004, -0.0001977622596314177, -0.04407147318124771, 0.05761813744902611, -0.01377713680267334, -0.006741322111338377, 0.021971717476844788, -0.011843728832900524, 0.013149739243090153, 0.012336683459579945, -0.01361068431288004, -0.004814315587282181, 0.007119040936231613, -0.024212421849370003, -0.032496631145477295, 0.007330307736992836, 0.0070038046687841415, -0.008002519607543945, 0.004103691782802343, 0.02346978895366192, -0.013092121109366417, -0.014148454181849957, -0.003969249315559864, -0.04888578876852989, 0.022688742727041245, 0.03521108627319336, -0.0074903578497469425, 0.024353265