 of Agentic RAG**: Enhanced decision-making, multi-step reasoning, and iterative refinement.\n\n4. **Core Components of RAG**: The architecture consists of three main components:\n   - **Retrieval**: Queries external data sources for relevant information.\n   - **Augmentation**: Processes and summarizes retrieved data.\n   - **Generation**: Combines retrieved information with pre-trained knowledge to produce coherent responses.\n\n5. **RAG Paradigm**: A table outlining different task roles, memory types, and workflows, including Naive RAG, Advanced RAG, Modular RAG, and Graph RAG.\n\n6. **Evolution of RAG Paradigms**: The development of RAG to meet the demands of complex real-world applications, emphasizing contextual accuracy, scalability, and multi-step reasoning.\n\nOverall, the section highlights the principles, architectures, applications, and future directions of Agentic RAG in dynamic AI systems."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "67f7d17c-65a8-47f0-8f2e-71490af5fab1", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_name": "AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 104275, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-20"}, "hash": "42831f3d26ca4cfa6d94fdd9504869cdd0ae1fd50debb205f921f3f248abd7cc", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "537faf4a-2890-4982-9493-4fdc24fa9ec6", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON 