ugmentation**: A Query Refinement Agent optimizes queries using semantic understanding to improve retrieval outcomes.\n\n2. **Overview of Agentic Corrective RAG**:\n   - **Dynamic Retrieval**: An External Knowledge Retrieval Agent supplements context by performing web searches or accessing alternative data sources when necessary.\n   - **Response Synthesis**: A Response Synthesis Agent compiles validated and refined information into a coherent final response.\n\n3. **Workflow**: The Corrective RAG system consists of five key agents:\n   - Context Retrieval Agent\n   - Relevance Evaluation Agent\n   - Query Refinement Agent\n   - External Knowledge Retrieval Agent\n   - Response Synthesis Agent\n\n4. **Key Features and Advantages**:\n   - Iterative Correction for high response accuracy.\n   - Dynamic Adaptability through real-time web searches and query refinement.\n   - Agentic Modularity for efficient and scalable operations.\n   - Factuality Assurance to minimize misinformation and hallucination risks.\n\n5. **Use Case**: The section includes a prompt for an academic research assistant, asking for the latest findings in generative AI research. \n\nOverall, the focus is on enhancing the accuracy and relevance of AI-generated responses through a structured agent-based approach."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "67f7d17c-65a8-47f0-8f2e-71490af5fab1", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_name": "AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 104275, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-20"}, "hash": "42831f3d26ca4cfa6d94fdd9504869cdd0ae1fd50debb205f921f3f248abd7cc", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "e5fe39cf-4dbe-4700-ab04-35c5d258f9f2", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_name": "AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 104275, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-20"}, "hash": "86f57b04f48b75578d3f3bc4fc8c4869f9538fe288222760f789b38dcf885036", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "55f0f141-fe0d-4ae3-8f9b-a07e5654a5e6", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "261bf849bb4bcf6c35fb34400dff648bb20ba7988341dc9d081df4ed97438866", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "By embedding intelligent agents into the workflow, Corrective RAG ensures iterative refinement of context documents and responses, minimizing errors and maximizing relevance.\n\n# Key Idea of Corrective RAG:\n\nThe core principle of Corrective RAG lies in its ability to evaluate retrieved documents dynamically, perform corrective actions, and refine queries to enhance the quality of generated responses. Corrective RAG adjusts its approach as follows:\n\n- Document Relevance Evaluation: Retrieved documents are assessed for relevance by the Relevance Evaluation Agent. Documents below the relevance threshold trigger corrective steps.\n- Query Refinement and Augmentation: Queries are refined by the Query Refinement Agent, which leverages semantic understanding to optimize retrieval for better results.\n---\n# Overview of Agentic Corrective RAG\n\n\u2022 Dynamic Retrieval from External Sources: When context is insufficient, the External Knowledge Retrieval Agent performs web searches or accesses alternative data sources to supplement the retrieved documents.\n\n\u2022 Response Synthesis: All validated and refined information is passed to the Response Synthesis Agent for final response generation.\n\n# Workflow\n\nThe Corrective RAG system is built on five key agents:\n\n1. Context Retrieval Agent: Responsible for retrieving initial context documents from a vector database.\n2. Relevance Evaluation Agent: Assesses the retrieved documents for relevance and flags any irrelevant or ambiguous documents for corrective actions.\n3. Query Refinement Agent: Rewrites queries to improve retrieval, leveraging semantic understanding to optimize results.\n4. External Knowledge Retrieval Agent: Performs web searches or accesses alternative data sources when the context documents are insufficient.\n5. Response Synthesis Agent: Synthesizes all validated information into a coherent and accurate response.\n\n# Key Features and Advantages\n\n\u2022 Iterative Correction: Ensures high response accuracy by dynamically identifying and correcting irrelevant or ambiguous retrieval results.\n\n\u2022 Dynamic Adaptability: Incorporates real-time web searches and query refinement for enhanced retrieval precision.\n\n\u2022 Agentic Modularity: Each agent performs specialized tasks, ensuring efficient and scalable operation.\n\n\u2022 Factuality Assurance: By validating all retrieved and generated content, Corrective RAG minimizes the risk of hallucination or misinformation.\n---\n# Use Case: Academic Research Assistant\n\n# Prompt: What are the latest findings in generative AI research?", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 43824, "end_char_idx": 46355, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "[Excerpt from document]\n{metadata_str}\nExcerpt:\n-----\n{content}\n-----\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "55f0f141-fe0d-4ae3-8f9b-a07e5654a5e6", "embedding": [-0.010018473491072655, 0.027060499414801598, 0.02690473571419716, 0.014386952854692936, -0.0