 -0.01192069984972477, 0.0017156784888356924, -0.008243397809565067, -0.020978260785341263, 0.013406546786427498, 0.016649628058075905, -0.0021609237883239985, -0.0076395608484745026, -0.019444921985268593, -0.04078955575823784, -0.04749282822012901, -0.00822982843965292, -0.0013196221552789211, -0.056394342333078384, -0.0021965433843433857, -0.03270220384001732, 0.007259618025273085, -0.01743665337562561, 0.008467293344438076, -0.010115972720086575, -0.019499199464917183, 0.01902426965534687, 0.016758184880018234], "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_name": "AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 104275, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-20", "document_title": "\"Agentic Retrieval-Augmented Generation: Principles, Architectures, Applications, and Future Directions in Dynamic AI Systems\"", "section_summary": "The section discusses the concept of Agentic Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) and its applications in various fields, particularly in education and marketing. Key topics include:\n\n1. **Use Case: Research Paper Generation** - Agentic RAG assists researchers by synthesizing findings from multiple sources, enhancing the quality and efficiency of academic work.\n\n2. **Key Benefits in Education**:\n   - **Tailored Learning Paths**: Customizes content based on individual student needs.\n   - **Engaging Interactions**: Offers interactive explanations and personalized feedback.\n   - **Scalability**: Supports large-scale educational deployments.\n\n3. **Graph-Enhanced Applications**: The section introduces Graph-Enhanced Agentic RAG (GEAR), which integrates graph structures with retrieval mechanisms for effective multimodal workflows.\n\n4. **Use Case: Market Survey Generation** - GEAR synthesizes various data types (text, images, videos) for marketing campaigns, providing insights into trends and customer preferences.\n\n5. **Key Benefits in Marketing**:\n   - **Multi-Modal Capabilities**: Combines different data formats for comprehensive outputs.\n   - **Enhanced Creativity**: Fosters innovative ideas for marketing and entertainment.\n   - **Dynamic Adaptability**: Adjusts to changing market trends and customer needs.\n\n6. **Overall Impact**: Agentic RAG systems are versatile and transformative, addressing complex challenges across industries by integrating retrieval, generation, and agentic intelligence.\n\n7. **Tools and Frameworks**: The section concludes by highlighting the evolution of Agentic RAG systems and the tools available for developing these advanced applications.\n\nEntities mentioned include:\n- Agentic RAG\n- Graph-Enhanced Agentic RAG (GEAR)\n- Higher education\n- Marketing campaigns\n- Quantum computing\n- Eco-friendly products\n\nOverall, the section emphasizes the potential of Agentic RAG systems to revolutionize various sectors through enhanced data synthesis and adaptability."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "67f7d17c-65a8-47f0-8f2e-71490af5fab1", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_name": "AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 104275, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-20"}, "hash": "42831f3d26ca4cfa6d94fdd9504869cdd0ae1fd50debb205f921f3f248abd7cc", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "40c138ed-8187-4c89-b677-e2aa5c4d1206", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_name": "AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 104275, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-20"}, "hash": "8295e5d1db318539e3967593f68573ca58198e8a92dac2f0bb818c11e1c0b2f4", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "692ec740-dba8-4d29-97ce-1f53842b3987", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "7b7032197e8f84e437dd86ebd45f293e0d5b5992300eb30afd9e393e0e41236e", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "# Use Case: Research Paper Generation [41]\n\nIn higher education, Agentic RAG has been used to assist researchers by synthesizing key findings from multiple sources. For instance, a researcher querying, \u201cWhat are the latest advancements in quantum computing?\u201d receives a concise summary enriched with references, enhancing the quality and efficiency of their work.\n\n# Key Benefits:\n\n- Tailored Learning Paths: Adapts content to individual student needs and performance levels.\n- Engaging Interactions: Provides interactive explanations and personalized feedback.\n- Scalability: Supports large-scale deployments for diverse educational environments.\n\n# 7.6 Graph-Enhanced Applications in Multimodal Workflows\n\nGraph-Enhanced Agentic RAG (GEAR) combines graph structures with retrieval mechanisms, making it particularly effective in multimodal workflows where interconnected data sources are essential.\n\n# Use Case: Market Survey Generation\n\nGEAR enables the synthesis of text, images, and videos for marketing campaigns. For example, querying, \u201cWhat are the emerging trends in eco-friendly products?\u201d generates a detailed report enriched with customer preferences, competitor analysis, and multimedia content.\n\n# Key Benefits:\n\n- Multi-Modal Capabilities: Integrates text, image, and video data for comprehensive outputs.\n- Enhanced Creativity: Generates innovative ideas and solutions for marketing and entertainment.\n- Dynamic Adaptability: Adapts to evolving market trends and customer needs.\n\nThe applications of Agentic RAG systems span a wide range of industries, showcasing their versatility and transformative potential. From personalized customer support to adaptive education and graph-enhanced multimodal workflows, these systems address complex, dynamic, and knowledge-intensive challenges. By integrating retrieval, generation, and agentic intelligence, Agentic RAG systems are paving the way for next-generation AI applications.\n\n# 8 Tools and Frameworks for Agentic RAG\n\nAgentic Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) systems represent a significant evolution in combining retrieval, generation, and agentic intelligence. These systems extend the capabilities of traditional RAG by integrating decision-making, query reformulation, and adaptive workflows. The following tools and frameworks provide robust support for developing Agentic RAG systems, addressing the complex requirements of real-world applications.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 70726, "end_char_idx": 73151, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "[Excerpt from document]\n{metadata_str}\nExcerpt:\n-----\n{content}\n-----\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "692ec740-dba8-4d29-97ce-1f53842b3987", "embedding": [-0.004950019530951977, 0.04435645043849945, 0.028270557522773743, 0.0014629613142460585, 0.005731601733714342, -0.016807354986667633, 0.0032382213976234198, 0.008931412361562252, -0.014362405054271221, 0.018490761518478394, 0.02370130829513073, -0.07134441286325455, -0.007147801574319601, -0.01774257980287075, 0.015417874790728092, 0.007782419677823782, -0.03885197639465332, -0.03679447993636131, -0.0119842579