 complete sentences, highlighting challenges in understanding context and semantics in language.\n\n5. **Chain-of-Thought Fine-Tuning**: The work by Seungone Kim et al. focuses on improving language models' performance in zero-shot and few-shot learning scenarios through a method called chain-of-thought fine-tuning.\n\n6. **Complex Sequential Question Answering**: The research by Amrita Saha et al. aims to enhance conversational capabilities over linked question-answer pairs using knowledge graphs, indicating a focus on structured information retrieval.\n\nEntities mentioned include notable researchers and contributors in the field, such as Tsung-Hsien Wen, Milica Ga\u0161i\u0107, Ruining He, Julian McAuley, Rowan Zellers, and Amrita Saha, among others. The section references various conferences and publications, emphasizing the ongoing research and development in AI and NLP."}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "67f7d17c-65a8-47f0-8f2e-71490af5fab1", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_name": "AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_type": "text/markdown", "file_size": 104275, "creation_date": "2025-03-25", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-20"}, "hash": "42831f3d26ca4cfa6d94fdd9504869cdd0ae1fd50debb205f921f3f248abd7cc", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "7a125ce8-ecab-4cb3-87d6-45ba57721455", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\ai_articles\\AGENTIC RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION A SURVEY ON AGENTIC RAG.md", "file_name"